      `the state in which the offender is found` IS A `s 7(2.2)(b) the state in which the offender is found` @desc In which kind of state were you found: a state, other than the one where it was done, that is a party to the 1988 Rome Convention on the safety of maritime navigation (an offence against or on board a ship), a state, other than the one where it was done, that is a party to the 1988 Rome Protocol on fixed platforms (an offence against or on board a platform), or neither? Choose which.
