@export Under section 7(2.3), is what I did deemed to have been committed in Canada?
GIVEN `the person is a Canadian crew member, by s 7(2.34)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a Canadian crew member (a crew member of the Space Station or of the Lunar Gateway who is a Canadian citizen, or a citizen of a foreign state other than a Partner State who is a crew member for Canada)?
      `the act or omission is during a space flight, by s 7(2.34)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it during a space flight (the period from the launch of the crew member to their landing on earth)?
