DECIDE `Under section 7(2.3), is what I did deemed to have been committed in Canada` IS
    `s 7(2.3) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` (`ccc1 a fact as an answer` `the person is a Canadian crew member, by s 7(2.34)`) (`ccc1 a fact as an answer` `the act or omission is during a space flight, by s 7(2.34)`) `the act or omission is committed outside Canada` `the class of offence the act or omission would be if committed in Canada` `the grounds that hold`
    WHERE
        `the grounds that hold` MEANS (append (IF `ground (a)` THEN LIST `s 7(2.3)(a) the act or omission is committed on, or in relation to, a flight element of the Space Station` ELSE EMPTY) (IF `ground (b)` THEN LIST `s 7(2.3)(b) the act or omission is committed on any means of transportation to or from the Space Station` ELSE EMPTY))

