      `ground (b)(ii)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is your act or omission committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations?
      `ground (c)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a Canadian citizen?
      `ground (d)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the complainant a Canadian citizen?
      `ground (e)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you, after the commission thereof, present in Canada?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 7(3.7), is what I did deemed to have been committed in Canada` IS
    `s 7(3.7) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` `the act or omission is committed outside Canada` (`Provision of the Code` OF `section number of the offence`, `subsection or paragraph of the offence`) `relation` `the grounds that hold`
    WHERE
        `the grounds that hold` MEANS (append (IF `ground (a)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.7)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, pursuant to any Act of Parliament` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (b)(i)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.7)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (b)(ii)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.7)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (c)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.7)(c) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (d)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.7)(d) the complainant is a Canadian citizen` ELSE EMPTY) (IF `ground (e)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.7)(e) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission thereof, present in Canada` ELSE EMPTY))))))

