DECIDE `Under section 7(3.71), is what I did deemed to have been committed in Canada` IS
    `s 7(3.71) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` `the act or omission is committed outside Canada` (`ccc1 a fact as an answer` `s 2 United Nations personnel: the person against whom the act or omission is committed is a member of it`) (`ccc1 a fact as an answer` `s 2 associated personnel: the person against whom the act or omission is committed is a member of it`) `it is against property referred to in section 431.1` (`Provision of the Code` OF `section number of the offence`, `subsection or paragraph of the offence`) `relation` `the grounds that hold`
    WHERE
        `the grounds that hold` MEANS (append (IF `ground (a)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(a) the act or omission is committed on a ship that is registered or licensed, or for which an identification number has been issued, under an Act of Parliament` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (b)(i)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(b)(i) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft registered in Canada under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (b)(ii)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(b)(ii) the act or omission is committed on an aircraft leased without crew and operated by a person who is qualified under regulations made under the Aeronautics Act to be registered as owner of an aircraft in Canada under those regulations` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (c)(i)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(c)(i) the person who commits the act or omission is a Canadian citizen` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (c)(ii)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(c)(ii) the person who commits the act or omission is not a citizen of any state and ordinarily resides in Canada` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (d)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(d) the person who commits the act or omission is, after the commission of the act or omission, present in Canada` ELSE EMPTY) (append (IF `ground (e)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(e) the act or omission is committed against a Canadian citizen` ELSE EMPTY) (IF `ground (f)` THEN LIST `s 7(3.71)(f) the act or omission is committed with intent to compel the Government of Canada or of a province to do or refrain from doing any act` ELSE EMPTY))))))))

