    `s 23.1 sections 21 to 23 apply in respect of the accused although the other person cannot be convicted` `the person whom the accused aids or abets, counsels or procures or receives, comforts or assists cannot be convicted of the offence`

@export Under section 24(1), am I guilty of an attempt to commit the offence?
