      `the senior official has the public officer's written report under section 25.2` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the senior official have the public officer's written report under section 25.2?
      `the person's property was lost or seriously damaged as a result of the act or omission` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was your property lost or seriously damaged as a result of the act or omission?
