DECIDE `Under section 25.4(1), is the senior official required to notify me in writing` IS
    `s 25.4(1) the senior official is required to notify the person in writing` `a public officer commits an act or omission, or directs the commission by another person of an act or omission, under paragraph 25.1(9)(a) or (b)` `the senior official has the public officer's written report under section 25.2` `the person's property was lost or seriously damaged as a result of the act or omission`

@export Under section 25.4(1), is the notification no later than one year after the commission of the act or omission?
GIVEN `the day of the commission of the act or omission` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the act or omission committed?
      `the day the senior official notified the person in writing` IS A DATE @desc On what day did the senior official notify you in writing?
