      `it is intoxication` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it intoxication?
      `it renders a person unaware of their behaviour` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the intoxication render a person unaware of their behaviour?
      `it renders a person incapable of consciously controlling their behaviour` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the intoxication render a person incapable of consciously controlling their behaviour?
      `the offence is under this Act or any other Act of Parliament` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offence under this Act or any other Act of Parliament?
      `it includes as an element an assault or any other interference or threat of interference by a person with the bodily integrity of another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the offence include as an element an assault or any other interference or threat of interference by a person with the bodily integrity of another person?
      `all the other elements of the offence are present` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are all the other elements of the offence present?
      `before they were in a state of extreme intoxication, they departed markedly from the standard of care expected of a reasonable person in the circumstances with respect to the consumption of intoxicating substances` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before you were in a state of extreme intoxication, did you depart markedly from the standard of care expected of a reasonable person in the circumstances with respect to the consumption of intoxicating substances?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 33.1(1), do I nonetheless commit the offence` IS
    `s 33.1(1) the person nonetheless commits the offence` `the person lacks the general intent or voluntariness ordinarily required to commit the offence` (`s 33.1(4) extreme intoxication` `it is intoxication` `it renders a person unaware of their behaviour` `it renders a person incapable of consciously controlling their behaviour`) (`s 33.1(3) section 33.1 applies in respect of the offence` `the offence is under this Act or any other Act of Parliament` `it includes as an element an assault or any other interference or threat of interference by a person with the bodily integrity of another person`) `all the other elements of the offence are present` `before they were in a state of extreme intoxication, they departed markedly from the standard of care expected of a reasonable person in the circumstances with respect to the consumption of intoxicating substances`

