    `Under sections 46 to 83, what the section states about the penalty of the offence` (`s 52.1(1) the class of the offence of sabotage of an essential infrastructure`) (`s 52.1(1) the punishment for sabotage of an essential infrastructure` `Under sections 46 to 83, a placeholder for the penalty of section 787(1)`)

@ref Criminal Code s 52.2(1), s 52.2(3)
@export Under section 52.2(1), have I committed the offence of dealing in a device for sabotage?
