GIVEN `the offence is one under subsection 52(1), 52.1(1) or 52.2(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offence charged one under subsection 52(1), 52.1(1) or 52.2(1)?
      `the Attorney General has consented to the proceeding` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the Attorney General consented to the proceeding?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
