      `I had a lawful excuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you have a lawful excuse?
      `the document is a passport as defined in section 2 of the Canadian Passport Order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a passport as defined in section 2 of the Canadian Passport Order? (Answer yes only if you know.)
      `the passport is forged` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the passport forged?
      `an offence under subsection 57(2) has been committed in respect of the passport` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has an offence under subsection 57(2) (a false statement to obtain it or alter it) been committed in respect of the passport?
