    `Under sections 46 to 83, what the section states about the penalty of the offence` (`s 57(3) the class of the offence under subsection 57(3)`) (`s 57(3) the punishment for an offence under subsection 57(3)` `Under sections 46 to 83, a placeholder for the penalty of section 787(1)`)

@ref Criminal Code s 57(4)(a)
