    `s 57(6) proceedings may be commenced, and the accused tried and punished, in a territorial division in Canada` `I am alleged to have committed the offence while out of Canada` `the offence is one under section 57` (`s 2 territorial division` `the place where the proceedings are to be commenced is`)

@ref Criminal Code s 57(7)
