GIVEN `the device is of the kind` IS A `s 82.2 kind of device` @desc Which kind of device is it? Choose the last choice if none fits.
      `the thing emits ionizing radiation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the material the device disperses emit one or more types of ionizing radiation, such as alpha or beta particles, neutrons and gamma rays?
