GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 82.2, is the thing a device for the purposes of sections 82.3 to 82.5` IS
    `s 82.2 the thing is a device for the purposes of sections 82.3 to 82.5` `the device is of the kind` (`s 2 radioactive material` `the thing emits ionizing radiation` `the material is capable of causing death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage to property or the environment`) `the device that emits ionizing radiation is capable of causing death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage to property or the environment`

