    `s 83.13(6) the judge must require notice to be given to, and may hear, the person` `the judge is about to make a destruction order` `in the judge's opinion I appear to have a valid interest in the property`

@export Under section 83.14(3), is the Attorney General required to name me as a respondent to the forfeiture application?
GIVEN `I am known to own or control the property that is the subject of the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you known to own or control the property that is the subject of the application?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 83.14(3), is the Attorney General required to name me as a respondent to the forfeiture application` IS
    `s 83.14(3) the person is required to be named as a respondent` `I am known to own or control the property that is the subject of the application`

@export Under section 83.14(7), am I entitled to be added as a respondent to the forfeiture application?
