GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 83.14(7), am I entitled to be added as a respondent to the forfeiture application` IS
    `s 83.14(7) the person is entitled to be added as a respondent` `the judge has required notice to be given to me under section 83.14(7)`

@export Under section 83.14(8), must the judge order that my interest in the property is not affected by the forfeiture?
GIVEN `I was ordered to be given notice of the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the judge require that you be given notice because you appeared to have an interest in the property?
      `I have an interest in property that is subject to the application` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have an interest in property that is subject to the application?
      `I exercised reasonable care to ensure that the property would not be used to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you exercise reasonable care to ensure that the property would not be used to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity?
      `I am a member of a terrorist group` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a member of a terrorist group?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 83.14(8), must the judge order that my interest in the property is not affected by the forfeiture` IS
    `s 83.14(8) the judge must order that the interest is not affected by the forfeiture` `I was ordered to be given notice of the application` `I have an interest in property that is subject to the application` `I exercised reasonable care to ensure that the property would not be used to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` `I am a member of a terrorist group`

@export Under section 83.14(10), may I bring a motion to vary or set aside the forfeiture order?
GIVEN `I claim an interest in property that was forfeited` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you claim an interest in property that was forfeited?
      `I did not receive notice under subsection (7)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you not receive the notice that a judge may require under section 83.14(7)?
      `the day the forfeiture order was made` IS A DATE @desc On what day was the forfeiture order made?
      `the day I bring the motion` IS A DATE @desc On what day do you bring, or will you bring, the motion?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 83.14(10), may I bring a motion to vary or set aside the forfeiture order` IS
    `s 83.14(10) the person may bring a motion to vary or set aside the order` `I claim an interest in property that was forfeited` `I did not receive notice under subsection (7)` `the day the forfeiture order was made` `the day I bring the motion`

@export Under section 83.17(2), is my property subject to forfeiture under section 83.14(5)?
GIVEN `the property is property owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group, or used or to be used to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it property owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group, or property that has been or will be used to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity?
      `it is required to satisfy another provision about restitution or compensation of persons affected by offences` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it required to satisfy the operation of another provision of this or any other Act of Parliament about restitution to, or compensation of, persons affected by the commission of offences?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 83.17(2), is my property subject to forfeiture under section 83.14(5)` IS
    `s 83.17(2) the property is subject to forfeiture under subsection 83.14(5)` `the property is property owned or controlled by or on behalf of a terrorist group, or used or to be used to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` `it is required to satisfy another provision about restitution or compensation of persons affected by offences`

§ `Participating in, helping or instructing for a terrorist group (ss 83.18 to 83.221)`

§§ `Is what I did an offence?`

@export Under section 83.18(1), is what I did the offence of participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group?
