      `I did it for the purpose of enhancing the ability of a terrorist group to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do it for the purpose of enhancing the ability of any terrorist group to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity?
      `the group is a terrorist group` IS A `s 83.01(1) seat answer` @desc Is the group a terrorist group within section 83.01(1)? Answer yes, no or I do not know.
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 83.18(1), is what I did the offence of participating in or contributing to an activity of a terrorist group` IS
    `s 83.18(1) the person is guilty of the offence` `I knowingly participated in or contributed to an activity of the group` `I did it for the purpose of enhancing the ability of a terrorist group to facilitate or carry out a terrorist activity` (`s 83.01(1) seat the answer as a yes, a no or not known` `the group is a terrorist group`)

@export Under section 83.18(2), is an offence under section 83.18(1) possible whether or not this circumstance occurred?
GIVEN `the circumstance` IS A `s 83.18(2) circumstance` @desc Which circumstance: a terrorist group actually facilitates or carries out a terrorist activity, your participation actually enhances a terrorist group's ability, you know the specific nature of any terrorist activity, or another circumstance?
