GIVEN `I left or tried to leave Canada, or went or tried to go on board a conveyance with the intent to leave Canada` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you leave or attempt to leave Canada, or go or attempt to go on board a conveyance with the intent to leave Canada?
      `it was for the purpose of committing an act or omission outside Canada that would be an offence under section 83.18(1) if committed in Canada` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it for the purpose of committing an act or omission outside Canada that, if committed in Canada, would be an offence under section 83.18(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
