    `s 83.181 the person is guilty of the offence` `I left or tried to leave Canada, or went or tried to go on board a conveyance with the intent to leave Canada` `it was for the purpose of committing an act or omission outside Canada that would be an offence under section 83.18(1) if committed in Canada`

