    `s 83.19(1) the person is guilty of the offence` `I knowingly facilitated the activity` (`s 83.01(1) seat the answer as a yes, a no or not known` `the activity is a terrorist activity`)

@export Under section 83.19(2), is a terrorist activity facilitated by what I did?
