      `I know that a particular terrorist activity is facilitated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know that a particular terrorist activity is facilitated?
      `any particular terrorist activity was foreseen or planned when it was facilitated` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was any particular terrorist activity foreseen or planned at the time it was facilitated?
      `any terrorist activity was actually carried out` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was any terrorist activity actually carried out?
