      `the general summary penalty: further days` IS A NUMBER @desc How many further days? (0 if none)
      `the general summary penalty is less a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does that term end a day short, as a term "less a day" does?
      `the general summary penalty: fine in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the most the general penalty allows as a fine, in dollars? (0 if it allows none)
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `Under section 83.231(3), what is the most I can be sentenced to, given the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS
    `s 83.02 seat the punishments in words` (`s 83.231(3) the punishments of the offence` `the general penalty`)
    WHERE
        `the general penalty` MEANS `s 83.231 seat the general summary penalty from the figures the person states` `the general summary penalty: years of imprisonment` `the general summary penalty: further months` `the general summary penalty: further days` `the general summary penalty is less a day` `the general summary penalty: fine in dollars`

