    `ccc4 seat: the penalty of the offence` OF `s 96(2) the class of the offence`, JUST (`s 96(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`), NOTHING   -- the third field: the penalty on summary conviction is not stated in this section; it is the general penalty of section 787(1), which another part encodes

@ref s 98(1)
@export Under section 98(1), have I committed an offence of breaking and entering to steal a firearm?
GIVEN `I broke and entered a place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you break and enter a place?
      `I intended to steal a firearm located in it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you intend to steal a firearm located in it?
      `I stole a firearm located in it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you steal a firearm located in it?
      `I broke out of a place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you break out of a place?
      `I had stolen a firearm located in the place before breaking out of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Had you stolen a firearm located in the place before breaking out of it?
      `I had entered the place with intent to steal a firearm located in it before breaking out of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Had you entered the place with intent to steal a firearm located in it before breaking out of it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 98(1), have I committed an offence of breaking and entering to steal a firearm` IS
    `s 98(1) the person commits an offence of breaking and entering to steal a firearm` `I broke and entered a place` `I intended to steal a firearm located in it` `I stole a firearm located in it` `I broke out of a place` `I had stolen a firearm located in the place before breaking out of it` `I had entered the place with intent to steal a firearm located in it before breaking out of it`

@ref s 98(2)
@export Under section 98(2), is the thing I broke into a place?
GIVEN `the thing` IS A STRING @desc What is it? Choose one of: "building", "structure", "part of a building or structure", "motor vehicle", "vessel", "aircraft", "railway vehicle", "container", "trailer" or "something else".
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 98(2), is the thing I broke into a place` IS
    `s 98(2) place` (`the place kind named`)
    WHERE
        `the place kind named` MEANS
            BRANCH
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "building" THEN `s 98(2) place: a building`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "structure" THEN `s 98(2) place: a structure`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "part of a building or structure" THEN `s 98(2) place: part of a building or structure`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "motor vehicle" THEN `s 98(2) place: a motor vehicle`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "vessel" THEN `s 98(2) place: a vessel`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "aircraft" THEN `s 98(2) place: an aircraft`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "railway vehicle" THEN `s 98(2) place: a railway vehicle`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "container" THEN `s 98(2) place: a container`
                IF `the thing` EQUALS "trailer" THEN `s 98(2) place: a trailer`
                OTHERWISE `s 98(2) place: a thing that is none of those`

@ref s 98(3)(a)
@export Under section 98(3), did I enter the place?
GIVEN `any part of my body was within the thing being entered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was any part of your body within the thing that was being entered?
      `any part of an instrument I used was within the thing being entered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was any part of an instrument that you used within the thing that was being entered?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 98(3), did I enter the place` IS
    `s 98(3)(a) the person enters` `any part of my body was within the thing being entered` `any part of an instrument I used was within the thing being entered`

@ref s 98(3)(b)
@export Under section 98(3), am I deemed to have broken and entered?
GIVEN `I obtained entrance by a threat or an artifice or by collusion with a person within` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you obtain entrance by a threat or an artifice or by collusion with a person within?
      `I entered without lawful justification or excuse by a permanent or temporary opening` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you enter, without lawful justification or excuse, by a permanent or temporary opening?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 98(3), am I deemed to have broken and entered` IS
    `s 98(3)(b) the person is deemed to have broken and entered` `I obtained entrance by a threat or an artifice or by collusion with a person within` `I entered without lawful justification or excuse by a permanent or temporary opening`

@ref s 98(4)
@export Under section 98(4), how is the offence classified and what is the punishment if I am prosecuted by indictment?
GIVETH A `ccc4 seat: the penalty of the offence`
DECIDE `Under section 98(4), how is the offence classified and what is the punishment if I am prosecuted by indictment` IS
    `ccc4 seat: the penalty of the offence` OF `s 98(4) the class of the offence`, JUST (`s 98(4) the punishment on indictment`), NOTHING   -- the penalty on summary conviction: this offence is indictable only, so there is none

@ref s 98.1
@export Under section 98.1, have I committed an offence of robbery to steal a firearm?
GIVEN `I committed a robbery within the meaning of section 343` IS A STRING @desc Did you commit a robbery within the meaning of section 343? Answer "yes", "no" or "not known".
      `I committed it with intent to steal a firearm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you commit it with intent to steal a firearm?
      `in the course of it I stole a firearm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In the course of it, did you steal a firearm?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 98.1, have I committed an offence of robbery to steal a firearm` IS
    `s 98.1 the person commits an offence of robbery to steal a firearm` (`ccc4 seat: yes, no or not known` `I committed a robbery within the meaning of section 343`) `I committed it with intent to steal a firearm` `in the course of it I stole a firearm`

@ref s 98.1
@export Under section 98.1, how is the offence classified and what is the punishment if I am prosecuted by indictment?
