    `ccc4 seat: the penalty of the offence` OF `s 101(2) the class of the offence`, JUST (`s 101(2)(a) the punishment on indictment`), NOTHING   -- the third field: the penalty on summary conviction is not stated in this section; it is the general penalty of section 787(1), which another part encodes

@ref s 102(1)
@export Under section 102(1), have I committed the offence of making an automatic firearm?
GIVEN `I altered a firearm so that it is capable of discharging projectiles in rapid succession during one pressure of the trigger` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you alter a firearm so that it is capable of discharging projectiles in rapid succession during one pressure of the trigger?
      `I manufactured or assembled a firearm that is capable of that` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you manufacture or assemble a firearm that is capable of discharging projectiles in rapid succession during one pressure of the trigger?
