@ref s 102.1(1)
@export Under section 102.1(1), have I committed an offence by possessing or accessing computer data for making a firearm?
GIVEN `the thing is computer data` IS A STRING @desc Is it computer data (as subsection 342.1(2) says)? Answer "yes", "no" or "not known".
      `I possessed or accessed it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you possess or access it?
      `the data pertain to a firearm, other than one deemed not to be a firearm by subsection 84(3), or to a prohibited device` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the data pertain to a firearm, other than a firearm that subsection 84(3) deems not to be a firearm, or to a prohibited device?
      `the data are capable of being used with a 3D printer, metal milling machine or similar computer system for manufacturing or trafficking` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the data capable of being used with a 3D printer, metal milling machine or similar computer system for the purpose of manufacturing or trafficking a firearm or prohibited device derived from them?
      `I acted under the authority of the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act under the authority of the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations made under an Act of Parliament?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 102.1(1), have I committed an offence by possessing or accessing computer data for making a firearm` IS
    `s 102.1(1) the person commits an offence of possession of computer data` (`ccc4 seat: yes, no or not known` `the thing is computer data`) `I possessed or accessed it` `the data pertain to a firearm, other than one deemed not to be a firearm by subsection 84(3), or to a prohibited device` `the data are capable of being used with a 3D printer, metal milling machine or similar computer system for manufacturing or trafficking` `I acted under the authority of the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations`

@ref s 102.1(2)
@export Under section 102.1(2), have I committed an offence by distributing computer data for making a firearm?
GIVEN `the thing is computer data` IS A STRING @desc Is it computer data (as subsection 342.1(2) says)? Answer "yes", "no" or "not known".
      `I distributed, published or made it available` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you distribute, publish or make it available?
      `the data pertain to a firearm, other than one deemed not to be a firearm by subsection 84(3), or to a prohibited device` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the data pertain to a firearm, other than a firearm that subsection 84(3) deems not to be a firearm, or to a prohibited device?
      `the data are capable of being used with a 3D printer, metal milling machine or similar computer system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the data capable of being used with a 3D printer, metal milling machine or similar computer system?
      `I knew that the data are intended to be used for manufacturing or trafficking` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know that the data are intended to be used for the purpose of manufacturing or trafficking a firearm or prohibited device derived from them?
      `I acted under the authority of the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act under the authority of the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations made under an Act of Parliament?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 102.1(2), have I committed an offence by distributing computer data for making a firearm` IS
    `s 102.1(2) the person commits an offence of distribution of computer data` (`ccc4 seat: yes, no or not known` `the thing is computer data`) `I distributed, published or made it available` `the data pertain to a firearm, other than one deemed not to be a firearm by subsection 84(3), or to a prohibited device` `the data are capable of being used with a 3D printer, metal milling machine or similar computer system` `I knew that the data are intended to be used for manufacturing or trafficking` `I acted under the authority of the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations`

