    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): the choice is not one of the words the question lists
    WHEN JUST k THEN `s 103(1) the person commits an offence of importing or exporting knowing it is unauthorized` k `it is a component or part, other than a firearm part, designed exclusively for an automatic firearm` (`ccc4 seat: yes, no or not known` `I imported it`) (`ccc4 seat: yes, no or not known` `I exported it`) `I knew that I was not authorized to do so under the Firearms Act or any other Act of Parliament or any regulations`

