    `s 117.0101(1) any person may make an ex parte application to a provincial court judge for an emergency limitations on access order` `Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that you live with, or are an associate of, another person who is prohibited by an order from possessing firearms and similar things` `Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that the other person would or might have access to any such thing in your possession`

@export Under section 117.0101(2), may the provincial court judge hold the hearing of the application in private?
