@export Under section 117.0101(6), may the provincial court judge issue a warrant authorizing a peace officer to search for and seize things in my possession?
GIVEN `Is the judge satisfied, by information on oath, that there are reasonable grounds to believe you possess, in a building, receptacle or place, a thing whose use and possession are subject to the terms of the emergency order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the judge satisfied, by information on oath, that there are reasonable grounds to believe you possess, in a building, receptacle or place, a thing whose use and possession are subject to the terms of the emergency order?
