      `Does the report, of a search without a warrant, show the grounds on which the officer concluded they were entitled to search, and the things seized (if any)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the report, of a search without a warrant, show the grounds on which the officer concluded they were entitled to search, and the things seized (if any)?
