§§ `s 117.0102 Order denying access to information`

@export Under section 117.0102(1), may the provincial court judge make an order prohibiting my access to, and the disclosure of, information about the emergency order and the search and seizure?
GIVEN `Has an emergency order been made under subsection 117.0101(3)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has an emergency order been made under subsection 117.0101(3)?
      `Is the application made by the person who applied for the emergency order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the application made by the person who applied for the emergency order?
      `Is the judge acting on the judge's own motion` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the judge acting on the judge's own motion?
      `Does the judge consider it necessary to protect the security of the person who applied, or anyone known to them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the judge consider it necessary to protect the security of the person who applied, or anyone known to them?
      `Does the information relate to the emergency order` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information relate to the emergency order?
      `Does the information relate to a warrant issued under subsection 117.0101(6)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information relate to a warrant issued under subsection 117.0101(6)?
      `Does the information relate to a search and seizure without a warrant under subsection 117.0101(7)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information relate to a search and seizure without a warrant under subsection 117.0101(7)?
      `Does the information relate to the order made under this subsection` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the information relate to the order made under this subsection?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 117.0102(1), may the provincial court judge make an order prohibiting my access to, and the disclosure of, information about the emergency order and the search and seizure` IS
    `s 117.0102(1) the provincial court judge may make an order prohibiting access to, and the disclosure of, information` `Has an emergency order been made under subsection 117.0101(3)` `Is the application made by the person who applied for the emergency order` `Is the judge acting on the judge's own motion` `Does the judge consider it necessary to protect the security of the person who applied, or anyone known to them` `Does the information relate to the emergency order` `Does the information relate to a warrant issued under subsection 117.0101(6)` `Does the information relate to a search and seizure without a warrant under subsection 117.0101(7)` `Does the information relate to the order made under this subsection`


@export Under section 117.0102(2), does the order denying access to information expire on the day in question?
GIVEN `What is the day in question` IS A DATE @desc What day are you asking about?
      `On what day does the emergency order made under subsection 117.0101(3) expire or get revoked` IS A DATE @desc On what day does the emergency order against you expire or get revoked?
      `Was the order denying access to information revoked earlier` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the order denying access to information revoked earlier?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 117.0102(2), does the order denying access to information expire on the day in question` IS
    `s 117.0102(2) the order made under subsection (1) expires on the day in question` `What is the day in question` `On what day does the emergency order made under subsection 117.0101(3) expire or get revoked` `Was the order denying access to information revoked earlier`

@export Under section 117.0102(3), on what day does the order denying access to information cease to have effect?
GIVEN `Was a date fixed under subsection 117.0104(1) for the hearing before the emergency order expires or is revoked` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a date fixed under subsection 117.0104(1) for the hearing of the application against you before the emergency order expires or is revoked?
      `What is the date fixed for the hearing` IS A DATE @desc What is the date fixed for the hearing?
      `Was the emergency order revoked before that date` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the emergency order against you revoked before that date?
      `On what day was it revoked` IS A DATE @desc On what day was it revoked? (any date if it was not revoked)
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
DECIDE `Under section 117.0102(3), on what day does the order denying access to information cease to have effect` IS
    `s 117.0102(3) the day on which the order made under subsection (1) ceases to have effect` `Was a date fixed under subsection 117.0104(1) for the hearing before the emergency order expires or is revoked` `What is the date fixed for the hearing` `Was the emergency order revoked before that date` `On what day was it revoked`

@export Under section 117.0102(4), are the documents about my emergency order to be placed in a packet and sealed by the judge?
