      `Is the applicant a firearms officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the applicant a firearms officer?
      `Is the applicant a chief firearms officer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the applicant a chief firearms officer?
      `Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that you live with, or are an associate of, a person prohibited by an order from possessing firearms and similar things` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that you live with, or are an associate of, a person prohibited by an order from possessing firearms and similar things?
      `Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that the other person would or might have access to such a thing in your possession` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that the other person would or might have access to such a thing in your possession?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 117.011(1), may a peace officer, firearms officer or chief firearms officer apply to a provincial court judge for an order limiting my use and possession of firearms and similar things` IS
    `s 117.011(1) a peace officer, firearms officer or chief firearms officer may apply to a provincial court judge for an order limiting access` (IF `Is the applicant a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING) `Is the applicant a firearms officer` `Is the applicant a chief firearms officer` `Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that you live with, or are an associate of, a person prohibited by an order from possessing firearms and similar things` `Does the applicant believe, on reasonable grounds, that the other person would or might have access to such a thing in your possession`

