    `s 117.011(2) the provincial court judge is bound to fix a date for the hearing and direct that notice be given to the person` `Has an application been made under subsection 117.011(1) for an order against you`

@export Under section 117.011(3), is the provincial court judge bound to hear all relevant evidence presented by or on behalf of the applicant and me?
GIVEN `Is the hearing of the application under subsection 117.011(1) being held` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the hearing of the application under subsection 117.011(1) being held?
      `Is the judge proceeding in your absence (ex parte) under subsection (4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the judge proceeding in your absence (ex parte) under subsection (4)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
