      `s 120(a): Are you a police commissioner or an officer of a juvenile court, or employed in the administration of criminal law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a police commissioner or an officer of a juvenile court, or employed in the administration of criminal law? (s 120(a))
      `s 120(a): Did you, directly or indirectly, accept, obtain, agree to accept or try to obtain, for yourself or anyone else, money, valuable consideration, an office, a place or employment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, directly or indirectly, accept, obtain, agree to accept or try to obtain, for yourself or anyone else, money, valuable consideration, an office, a place or employment? (s 120(a))
      `s 120(a): Did you act corruptly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act corruptly? (s 120(a))
