DECIDE `Under section 121(2), is subscribing to an election fund to obtain or retain a government contract an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 121(2) the contractor subscribes to an election fund to obtain or retain a government contract` `Did you, directly or indirectly, subscribe or give, or agree to subscribe or give, any valuable consideration to anyone` `Was it in order to obtain or retain a contract with the government, or as a term of such a contract, express or implied` `Was it for the purpose of promoting the election of a candidate, or a class or party of candidates, to Parliament or a provincial legislature` `Was it with intent to influence or affect in any way the result of an election of persons to Parliament or a provincial legislature`

