      `s 121.1(1): Did you have in your possession, for the purpose of sale, a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you have in your possession, for the purpose of sale, a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged? (s 121.1(1))
      `s 121.1(1): Is the tobacco product or raw leaf tobacco stamped, as section 2 of the Excise Act, 2001 uses the word` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the tobacco product or raw leaf tobacco stamped, as section 2 of the Excise Act, 2001 uses the word? (s 121.1(1))
      `s 121.1(2): Are your circumstances any of those that subsections 30(2), 32(2) or 32(3) of the Excise Act, 2001 describe` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are your circumstances any of those that subsections 30(2), 32(2) or 32(3) of the Excise Act, 2001 describe? (s 121.1(1))
      `s 121.1(3): Are you a tobacco grower` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a tobacco grower? (s 121.1(1))
      `s 121.1(3): Is the raw leaf tobacco you possess described in paragraph 31(a), (b) or (c) of the Excise Act, 2001` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the raw leaf tobacco you possess described in paragraph 31(a), (b) or (c) of the Excise Act, 2001? (s 121.1(1))
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 121.1(1), is selling, transporting or possessing for sale unstamped tobacco an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 121.1(4) the person who contravenes subsection (1) is guilty of an offence` (`s 121.1(1) the person deals in unstamped tobacco` `s 121.1(1): Did you sell, offer for sale, transport, deliver or distribute a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged` `s 121.1(1): Did you have in your possession, for the purpose of sale, a tobacco product, or raw leaf tobacco that is not packaged` `s 121.1(1): Is the tobacco product or raw leaf tobacco stamped, as section 2 of the Excise Act, 2001 uses the word` (`s 121.1(2) subsection (1) does not apply in the circumstances the Excise Act, 2001 describes` `s 121.1(2): Are your circumstances any of those that subsections 30(2), 32(2) or 32(3) of the Excise Act, 2001 describe`) (`s 121.1(3) the tobacco grower does not contravene subsection (1) by reason only of possessing raw leaf tobacco described in section 31 of the Excise Act, 2001` `s 121.1(3): Are you a tobacco grower` `s 121.1(3): Is the raw leaf tobacco you possess described in paragraph 31(a), (b) or (c) of the Excise Act, 2001`))

