§§ `s 123 Municipal corruption`

@export Under section 123(1), is giving or taking a benefit for a municipal official's vote or official act an offence on what I did?
GIVEN `Is the person who gives or takes the benefit, or the person it is given to, a municipal official, as section 123(3) defines the term (a member of a municipal council, or a person who holds an office under a municipal government)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person who gives or takes the benefit, or the person it is given to, a municipal official, as section 123(3) defines the term (a member of a municipal council, or a person who holds an office under a municipal government)?
      `Did you, directly or indirectly, give, offer or agree to give or offer a loan, reward, advantage or benefit of any kind to a municipal official, or to anyone for their benefit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, directly or indirectly, give, offer or agree to give or offer a loan, reward, advantage or benefit of any kind to a municipal official, or to anyone for their benefit?
      `Being a municipal official, did you, directly or indirectly, demand, accept, or offer or agree to accept a loan, reward, advantage or benefit of any kind, for yourself or another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Being a municipal official, did you, directly or indirectly, demand, accept, or offer or agree to accept a loan, reward, advantage or benefit of any kind, for yourself or another person?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of it?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to perform or fail to perform an official act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to perform or fail to perform an official act?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 123(1), is giving or taking a benefit for a municipal official's vote or official act an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 123(1) the person gives, or the municipal official takes, a benefit for a vote or an official act` (IF `Is the person who gives or takes the benefit, or the person it is given to, a municipal official, as section 123(3) defines the term (a member of a municipal council, or a person who holds an office under a municipal government)` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING) `Did you, directly or indirectly, give, offer or agree to give or offer a loan, reward, advantage or benefit of any kind to a municipal official, or to anyone for their benefit` `Being a municipal official, did you, directly or indirectly, demand, accept, or offer or agree to accept a loan, reward, advantage or benefit of any kind, for yourself or another person` `Is it as consideration for the official to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of it` `Is it as consideration for the official to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution` `Is it as consideration for the official to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution` `Is it as consideration for the official to perform or fail to perform an official act`

@export Under section 123(1), is the offence indictable, punishable on summary conviction, or both?
GIVETH A `Class of offence`
DECIDE `Under section 123(1), is the offence indictable, punishable on summary conviction, or both` IS
    `s 123(1) the class of the offence`

@export Under section 123(1), what is the greatest imprisonment I face on indictment?
GIVETH A Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 123(1), what is the greatest imprisonment I face on indictment` IS
    `s 123(1) the punishment on indictment`

@export Under section 123(2), is influencing or attempting to influence a municipal official by suppression of the truth, threats, deceit or unlawful means an offence on what I did?
GIVEN `Is the person who gives or takes the benefit, or the person it is given to, a municipal official, as section 123(3) defines the term (a member of a municipal council, or a person who holds an office under a municipal government)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the person who gives or takes the benefit, or the person it is given to, a municipal official, as section 123(3) defines the term (a member of a municipal council, or a person who holds an office under a municipal government)?
      `Did you influence, or try to influence, a municipal official` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you influence, or try to influence, a municipal official?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of it?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution?
      `Is it as consideration for the official to perform or fail to perform an official act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it as consideration for the official to perform or fail to perform an official act?
      `Did you do it by suppressing the truth, when you were under a duty to disclose it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do it by suppressing the truth, when you were under a duty to disclose it?
      `Did you do it by threats or deceit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do it by threats or deceit?
      `Did you do it by any unlawful means` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do it by any unlawful means?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 123(2), is influencing or attempting to influence a municipal official by suppression of the truth, threats, deceit or unlawful means an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 123(2) the person influences or attempts to influence a municipal official by suppression of the truth, threats, deceit or unlawful means` (IF `Is the person who gives or takes the benefit, or the person it is given to, a municipal official, as section 123(3) defines the term (a member of a municipal council, or a person who holds an office under a municipal government)` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING) `Did you influence, or try to influence, a municipal official` `Is it as consideration for the official to abstain from voting at a meeting of the municipal council or a committee of it` `Is it as consideration for the official to vote in favour of or against a measure, motion or resolution` `Is it as consideration for the official to aid in procuring or preventing the adoption of a measure, motion or resolution` `Is it as consideration for the official to perform or fail to perform an official act` `Did you do it by suppressing the truth, when you were under a duty to disclose it` `Did you do it by threats or deceit` `Did you do it by any unlawful means`

@export Under section 123(2), is the offence indictable, punishable on summary conviction, or both?
GIVETH A `Class of offence`
DECIDE `Under section 123(2), is the offence indictable, punishable on summary conviction, or both` IS
    `s 123(2) the class of the offence`

