      `s 124(a): Did you receive, or agree to receive, a reward or profit from such a purported sale` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive, or agree to receive, a reward or profit from such a purported sale? (s 124(a))
      `s 124(b): Did you purport to purchase such an appointment, resignation or consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you purport to purchase such an appointment, resignation or consent? (s 124(b))
      `s 124(b): Did you give a reward or profit for such a purported purchase` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you give a reward or profit for such a purported purchase? (s 124(b))
      `s 124(b): Did you agree or promise to purchase, or to give a reward or profit for, such an appointment, resignation or consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you agree or promise to purchase, or to give a reward or profit for, such an appointment, resignation or consent? (s 124(b))
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 124, is selling or purchasing, or purporting to sell or purchase, an office an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 124 the person is guilty of an offence under section 124` (`s 124(a) the person purports to sell an appointment to or resignation from an office, or takes a reward for it` `s 124(a): Did you purport to sell, or agree to sell, an appointment to or a resignation from an office, or a consent to one` `s 124(a): Did you receive, or agree to receive, a reward or profit from such a purported sale`) (`s 124(b) the person purports to purchase an appointment to or resignation from an office, or gives a reward for it` `s 124(b): Did you purport to purchase such an appointment, resignation or consent` `s 124(b): Did you give a reward or profit for such a purported purchase` `s 124(b): Did you agree or promise to purchase, or to give a reward or profit for, such an appointment, resignation or consent`)

