§§ `s 125 Influencing or negotiating appointments or dealing in offices`

@export Under section 125, is influencing or negotiating appointments, or dealing in offices, an offence on what I did?
GIVEN `s 125(a): Did you, directly or indirectly, receive or agree to receive a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, directly or indirectly, receive or agree to receive a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind? (s 125(a))
      `s 125(a): Did you, directly or indirectly, give or procure to be given a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you, directly or indirectly, give or procure to be given a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind? (s 125(a))
      `s 125(a): Was it as consideration for cooperation, assistance or exercise of influence to secure the appointment of any person to an office` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it as consideration for cooperation, assistance or exercise of influence to secure the appointment of any person to an office? (s 125(a))
      `s 125(b): Did you solicit, recommend or negotiate in any manner about an appointment to or a resignation from an office` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you solicit, recommend or negotiate in any manner about an appointment to or a resignation from an office? (s 125(b))
      `s 125(b): Was it in expectation of a direct or indirect reward, advantage or benefit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it in expectation of a direct or indirect reward, advantage or benefit? (s 125(b))
      `s 125(c): Do you keep a place for transacting or negotiating business` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you keep a place for transacting or negotiating business? (s 125(c))
      `s 125(c): Do you have lawful authority to keep the place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you have lawful authority to keep the place? (s 125(c))
      `s 125(c): Does the business relate to the filling of vacancies in offices` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the business relate to the filling of vacancies in offices? (s 125(c))
      `s 125(c): Does the business relate to the sale or purchase of offices` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the business relate to the sale or purchase of offices? (s 125(c))
      `s 125(c): Does the business relate to appointments to or resignations from offices` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the business relate to appointments to or resignations from offices? (s 125(c))
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 125, is influencing or negotiating appointments, or dealing in offices, an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 125 the person is guilty of an offence under section 125` (`s 125(a) the person receives, gives or procures a reward as consideration for influence to secure an appointment to an office` `s 125(a): Did you, directly or indirectly, receive or agree to receive a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind` `s 125(a): Did you, directly or indirectly, give or procure to be given a reward, advantage or benefit of any kind` `s 125(a): Was it as consideration for cooperation, assistance or exercise of influence to secure the appointment of any person to an office`) (`s 125(b) the person solicits, recommends or negotiates about an appointment to or resignation from an office in expectation of a reward` `s 125(b): Did you solicit, recommend or negotiate in any manner about an appointment to or a resignation from an office` `s 125(b): Was it in expectation of a direct or indirect reward, advantage or benefit`) (`s 125(c) the person without lawful authority keeps a place for transacting business relating to offices` `s 125(c): Do you keep a place for transacting or negotiating business` `s 125(c): Do you have lawful authority to keep the place` `s 125(c): Does the business relate to the filling of vacancies in offices` `s 125(c): Does the business relate to the sale or purchase of offices` `s 125(c): Does the business relate to appointments to or resignations from offices`)

