§§ `s 128 Misconduct of officers executing process`

@export Under section 128, is misconduct, or a false return, by a peace officer or coroner executing process an offence on what I did?
GIVEN `s 128(a): Are you a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term? (s 128(a))
      `s 128(a): Are you a coroner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a coroner? (s 128(a))
      `s 128(a): Are you entrusted with the execution of a process` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you entrusted with the execution of a process? (s 128(a))
      `s 128(a): Did you intentionally misconduct yourself in the execution of the process` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you intentionally misconduct yourself in the execution of the process? (s 128(a))
      `s 128(b): Are you a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term? (s 128(b))
      `s 128(b): Are you a coroner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a coroner? (s 128(b))
      `s 128(b): Are you entrusted with the execution of a process` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you entrusted with the execution of a process? (s 128(b))
      `s 128(b): Did you intentionally make a false return to the process` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you intentionally make a false return to the process? (s 128(b))
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 128, is misconduct, or a false return, by a peace officer or coroner executing process an offence on what I did` IS
    `s 128 the person is guilty of an offence under section 128` (`s 128(a) the peace officer or coroner intentionally misconducts themselves in the execution of a process` (IF `s 128(a): Are you a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING) `s 128(a): Are you a coroner` `s 128(a): Are you entrusted with the execution of a process` `s 128(a): Did you intentionally misconduct yourself in the execution of the process`) (`s 128(b) the peace officer or coroner intentionally makes a false return to a process` (IF `s 128(b): Are you a peace officer, as section 2 of the Code defines the term` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING) `s 128(b): Are you a coroner` `s 128(b): Are you entrusted with the execution of a process` `s 128(b): Did you intentionally make a false return to the process`)

