DECIDE `Under section 145(5), what is the greatest imprisonment I face on indictment for failing to comply with a release order condition` IS
    `s 145(5) the punishment on indictment`

@export Under section 145(9), is the certificate evidence of its statements without proof of the signature or official character of the person who signed it?
GIVEN `Is the certificate that of the clerk of the court or a judge of the court before which you are alleged to have failed to attend, or of the person in charge of the place where you are alleged to have failed to attend for the purposes of the Identification of Criminals Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the certificate that of the clerk of the court or a judge of the court before which you are alleged to have failed to attend, or of the person in charge of the place where you are alleged to have failed to attend for the purposes of the Identification of Criminals Act?
      `In proceedings under subsection (2), does the certificate state that you failed to attend court as the release order required, or failed to attend again, or failed to surrender` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In proceedings under subsection (2), does the certificate state that you failed to attend court as the release order required, or failed to attend again, or failed to surrender?
      `In proceedings under subsection (3), does the certificate state that you were named in a confirmed appearance notice and failed to attend or appear` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In proceedings under subsection (3), does the certificate state that you were named in a confirmed appearance notice and failed to attend or appear?
      `In proceedings under subsection (3), does the certificate state that a summons was served on you and you failed to attend or appear` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In proceedings under subsection (3), does the certificate state that a summons was served on you and you failed to attend or appear?
      `In proceedings under subsection (4), does the certificate state that you were at large on a confirmed undertaking and failed to attend or appear` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In proceedings under subsection (4), does the certificate state that you were at large on a confirmed undertaking and failed to attend or appear?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 145(9), is the certificate evidence of its statements without proof of the signature or official character of the person who signed it` IS
    `s 145(9) the certificate is evidence of the statements it contains without proof of the signature or the official character` `Is the certificate that of the clerk of the court or a judge of the court before which you are alleged to have failed to attend, or of the person in charge of the place where you are alleged to have failed to attend for the purposes of the Identification of Criminals Act` `In proceedings under subsection (2), does the certificate state that you failed to attend court as the release order required, or failed to attend again, or failed to surrender` `In proceedings under subsection (3), does the certificate state that you were named in a confirmed appearance notice and failed to attend or appear` `In proceedings under subsection (3), does the certificate state that a summons was served on you and you failed to attend or appear` `In proceedings under subsection (4), does the certificate state that you were at large on a confirmed undertaking and failed to attend or appear`

@export Under section 145(10), may I, with leave of the court, require the person who made the certificate to attend for cross-examination?
GIVEN `Is a certificate of the kind section 145(9) describes produced against you` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a certificate of the kind section 145(9) describes produced against you?
      `Does the court give leave` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the court give leave?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
