    `s 145(10) the accused may, with leave of the court, require the person who made the certificate to attend for cross-examination` `Is a certificate of the kind section 145(9) describes produced against you` `Does the court give leave`

@export Under section 145(11), is the certificate barred from reception in evidence against me for want of reasonable notice before the trial?
