      `Before the trial, did the party who intends to produce the certificate give you reasonable notice of that intention together with a copy of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Before the trial, did the party who intends to produce the certificate give you reasonable notice of that intention together with a copy of it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
