§§ `s 149 Service of term for escape`

@export Under section 149(1), may the court order that my term of imprisonment for an escape be served in a penitentiary?
GIVEN `s 149(2): Did you break prison` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you break prison?
      `s 149(2): Did you escape from lawful custody` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you escape from lawful custody?
      `s 149(2): Were you, without lawful excuse, at large before the end of a term of imprisonment you were sentenced to` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you, without lawful excuse, at large before the end of a term of imprisonment you were sentenced to?
      `Did you commit the escape while undergoing imprisonment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you commit the escape while undergoing imprisonment?
      `Is the time you must serve less than two years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the time you must serve less than two years?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 149(1), may the court order that my term of imprisonment for an escape be served in a penitentiary` IS
    `s 149(1) the court may order that the term of imprisonment for an escape be served in a penitentiary` (`s 149(2) escape` `s 149(2): Did you break prison` `s 149(2): Did you escape from lawful custody` `s 149(2): Were you, without lawful excuse, at large before the end of a term of imprisonment you were sentenced to`) `Did you commit the escape while undergoing imprisonment` `Is the time you must serve less than two years`

