    `s 161(1) the court shall consider making an order of prohibition` `I was convicted, or discharged on the conditions of a probation order` (`s 161(1.1) the offence is one referred to in subsection (1.1)` (`s 161(1.1)(a) an offence under this Act` (`Provision of the Code` OF `the section of my offence`, `the subsection of my offence`))) `the person I offended against was this many years old`

