§ `s 163.1 -- child sexual abuse and exploitation material`

@export Under section 163.1(1), is the material child sexual abuse and exploitation material?
GIVEN `it is a photographic, film, video or other visual representation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a photographic, film, video or other visual representation (made by electronic or mechanical means or not)?
      `it is written material` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it written material?
      `it is an audio recording` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an audio recording?
      `it shows a person under 18, or depicted as under 18, engaged in explicit sexual activity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it show a person who is, or is depicted as being, under the age of eighteen years and engaged in, or depicted as engaged in, explicit sexual activity?
      `a dominant characteristic of the visual representation is the depiction, for a sexual purpose, of a sexual organ of a person under 18` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a dominant characteristic of the visual representation the depiction, for a sexual purpose, of a sexual organ of a person under the age of eighteen years?
