§ `ss 167 to 169 -- theatrical performances and the mails`

@export Under section 167(1), is what I did presenting an immoral theatrical performance?
GIVEN `I am the lessee, manager, agent or person in charge of the place` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the lessee, manager, agent or person in charge of the place?
      `the place is a theatre` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the place a theatre (a place that is open to the public and where entertainments are given)?
      `what I did` IS A `s 167(1) what the person did` @desc What did you do: s 167(1) presents, s 167(1) gives, s 167(1) allows to be presented or given, or s 167(1) none of those?
      `the performance is immoral, indecent or obscene` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the performance, entertainment or representation immoral, indecent or obscene?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 167(1), is what I did presenting an immoral theatrical performance` IS
    `s 167(1) the conduct is the offence of presenting an immoral theatrical performance` `I am the lessee, manager, agent or person in charge of the place` (IF `the place is a theatre` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE) `what I did` `the performance is immoral, indecent or obscene`

@export Under section 167(2), is what I did taking part in an immoral theatrical performance?
GIVEN `I take part or appear as an actor, performer or assistant in any capacity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you take part or appear as an actor, a performer or an assistant in any capacity?
      `the performance is immoral, indecent or obscene` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the performance, entertainment or representation immoral, indecent or obscene?
      `the place is a theatre` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the place a theatre?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 167(2), is what I did taking part in an immoral theatrical performance` IS
    `s 167(2) the conduct is the offence of taking part in an immoral theatrical performance` `I take part or appear as an actor, performer or assistant in any capacity` `the performance is immoral, indecent or obscene` (IF `the place is a theatre` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE)

@export Under section 168(1), is what I did mailing obscene matter?
GIVEN `I made use of the mails` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make use of the mails?
      `it was for the purpose of transmitting or delivering something` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it for the purpose of transmitting or delivering something?
      `the thing is obscene, indecent, immoral or scurrilous` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing obscene, indecent, immoral or scurrilous?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 168(1), is what I did mailing obscene matter` IS
    `s 168(1) the conduct is the offence of mailing obscene matter` `I made use of the mails` `it was for the purpose of transmitting or delivering something` `the thing is obscene, indecent, immoral or scurrilous`

@export Under section 168(2), does subsection (1) apply to me?
GIVEN `I print or publish matter for use in judicial proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you print or publish matter for use in connection with judicial proceedings or communicate it to persons concerned in the proceedings?
      `I print or publish a notice or report under the direction of a court` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you print or publish a notice or report under the direction of a court?
      `I print or publish it in a genuine series of law reports` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you print or publish the matter in a volume or part of a genuine series of law reports that consists solely of reports of proceedings in courts of law?
      `I print or publish it in a technical publication for the legal or medical profession` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you print or publish the matter in a publication of a technical character intended in good faith for circulation among members of the legal or medical profession?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 168(2), does subsection (1) apply to me` IS
    `s 168(2) subsection (1) applies to the person` `I print or publish matter for use in judicial proceedings` `I print or publish a notice or report under the direction of a court` `I print or publish it in a genuine series of law reports` `I print or publish it in a technical publication for the legal or medical profession`

@export Under section 169, what punishments am I liable to for an offence under section 163, 167 or 168?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 169, what punishments am I liable to for an offence under section 163, 167 or 168` IS
    LIST `s 169(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `ss 150 to 182 the penalty of s 787(1) is not stated in Part V`)

§ `ss 169.1 to 172.2 -- offences against children`

@export Under section 169.1(5), is the person a young person?
