GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 169.1(5), is the person a young person` IS
    `s 169.1(5) young person` `the age of the person in years`

@export Under section 169.1(1), is what I did recruiting a young person to an offence?
GIVEN `the age of the young person in years` IS A NUMBER @desc How old is the young person, in years?
      `I am in a position of trust, power or authority towards the young person for another reason` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you in a position of trust, power or authority towards the young person for any other reason?
      `I knew that the young person is under 18` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know that the young person is under 18 years of age?
      `I was reckless as to the young person being under 18` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you reckless as to the young person being under 18 years of age?
      `what I did` IS A `s 169.1(1) what the person did` @desc What did you do: s 169.1(1) recruits, s 169.1(1) counsels, s 169.1(1) encourages, s 169.1(1) invites, or s 169.1(1) none of those?
      `it was to be a party to an offence under the Code or the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it to be a party to an offence under the Criminal Code or the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act?
      `the young person is afterwards a party to that offence or a related one` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the young person afterwards a party to that offence or an offence related to it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 169.1(1), is what I did recruiting a young person to an offence` IS
    `s 169.1(1) the conduct is the offence of recruiting a young person to an offence` (`s 169.1(5) young person` `the age of the young person in years`) (`s 169.1(2) the person is considered to be in a position of trust, power or authority towards the young person` `the age of the young person in years`) `I am in a position of trust, power or authority towards the young person for another reason` `I knew that the young person is under 18` `I was reckless as to the young person being under 18` `what I did` `it was to be a party to an offence under the Code or the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act` `the young person is afterwards a party to that offence or a related one`

@export Under section 169.1(3), does the bar apply so that my belief that the young person was at least 18 is no defence?
GIVEN `I believed that the young person was at least 18 years of age` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you believe that the young person was at least 18 years of age?
      `I took reasonable steps to ascertain the age of the young person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you take reasonable steps to ascertain the young person's age?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 169.1(3), does the bar apply so that my belief that the young person was at least 18 is no defence` IS
    `s 169.1(3) the belief that the young person was at least 18 is not a defence: the bar applies` `I believed that the young person was at least 18 years of age` `I took reasonable steps to ascertain the age of the young person`

@export Under section 169.1(4), what punishments am I liable to for recruiting a young person?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 169.1(4), what punishments am I liable to for recruiting a young person` IS
    LIST `s 169.1(4)(a) the punishment on indictment`, (`s 169.1(4)(b) the punishment on summary conviction` `ss 150 to 182 the penalty of s 787(1) is not stated in Part V`)

