      `it is an audio recording whose dominant characteristic is describing explicit sexual activity for a sexual purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an audio recording whose dominant characteristic is the description, presentation or representation, for a sexual purpose, of explicit sexual activity involving a person?
