      `the section of the offence I meant to facilitate` IS A NUMBER @desc Which offence did you mean to facilitate: which section of the Criminal Code (for example 151)?
      `the subsection of the offence I meant to facilitate` IS A STRING @desc Which subsection, as the Code writes it (for example "(1)"), or "" if none?
      `it was for the purpose of facilitating that offence with respect to that person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it for the purpose of facilitating the commission of that offence with respect to that person?
