    `s 171.1(1) the conduct is the offence of making sexually explicit material available to a child` `what I did` (IF `the material is sexually explicit material` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE JUST FALSE) `the actual age of the person in years` `the age I believed the person to be, in years` (`Provision of the Code` OF `the section of the offence I meant to facilitate`, `the subsection of the offence I meant to facilitate`) `it was for the purpose of facilitating that offence with respect to that person`

