      `the day the period ends` IS A DATE @desc On what date does it end?
      statute IS A `s 183 statute` @desc Which Act is the offence in?
      section IS A NUMBER @desc What is the section number of the offence, as a decimal?
      subsection IS A STRING @desc What is the subsection or paragraph of the offence, as the Act writes it ("" for the whole section)?
      `it was committed for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with a group` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with a group?
      `the group is a criminal organization` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that group a criminal organization?
      `the offence is a terrorism offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offence a terrorism offence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 186(4), is the period of the authorization within the limit in paragraph (e): sixty days, or the longer period section 186.1 allows` IS
    `s 186(4)(e) the period of the authorization is within the limit` `the day the period begins` `the day the period ends`
        (`s 186.1 a period exceeding sixty days is permitted for the offence` (`s 183 seat the provision of an Act` statute section subsection) `it was committed for the benefit of, at the direction of or in association with a group` (`s 2 criminal organization` (`s 183 as a three-valued answer` `the group is a criminal organization`)) (`s 183 as a three-valued answer` `the offence is a terrorism offence`))

