`Under section 202(2), how serious is each offence under section 202, and what can it cost me` MEANS
    `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty of an offence` `s 202(1) the class of the offence` (`s 202(2) the punishment` `how many times have I been convicted before of an offence under section 202`)

@export Under section 203, have I committed the offence of placing bets on behalf of others?
