§ `Pari-mutuel betting (section 204)`

-- What the exemption and the duties mean for a person who bets or runs a pari-mutuel system.
@export Under section 204(1), do sections 201 and 202 not apply to a private bet between me and another individual?
GIVEN `the bet is a private bet between individuals` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the bet a private bet between individuals?
      `the individuals are engaged in the business of betting` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the individuals engaged in any way in the business of betting?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 204(1), do sections 201 and 202 not apply to a private bet between me and another individual` MEANS
    `s 204(1)(b) sections 201 and 202 do not apply to the private bet` `the bet is a private bet between individuals` `the individuals are engaged in the business of betting`

@export Under section 204(3), am I prohibited from using a pari-mutuel system of betting on a horse-race?
GIVEN `the system has been approved and is supervised by an officer appointed by the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the system been approved by an officer appointed by the Minister of Agriculture and Agri-Food, and is its operation carried on under the supervision of such an officer?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 204(3), am I prohibited from using a pari-mutuel system of betting on a horse-race` MEANS
    `s 204(3) the person or association is prohibited from using the pari-mutuel system` `the system has been approved and is supervised by an officer appointed by the Minister`

@export Under section 204(5), am I prohibited from deducting or retaining an amount from the money bet under a pari-mutuel system?
GIVEN `the deduction or retention is made under section 204(6)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the deduction or retention one that section 204(6) lets an association make from the total amount bet for the pool?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 204(5), am I prohibited from deducting or retaining an amount from the money bet under a pari-mutuel system` MEANS
    `s 204(5) the person or association is prohibited from deducting or retaining an amount` `the deduction or retention is made under section 204(6)`

@export Under section 204(10), have I committed the offence of contravening section 204 or its regulations?
GIVEN `I contravened or failed to comply with a provision of section 204 or of the regulations made under it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you contravene, or fail to comply with, a provision of section 204 or of the regulations made under it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 204(10), have I committed the offence of contravening section 204 or its regulations` MEANS
    `s 204(10) the person commits the offence` `I contravened or failed to comply with a provision of section 204 or of the regulations made under it`

@export Under section 204(10), how serious is the offence of contravening section 204 or its regulations, and what can it cost me?
GIVETH A `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty`
`Under section 204(10), how serious is the offence of contravening section 204 or its regulations, and what can it cost me` MEANS
    `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty of an offence` `s 204(10) the class of the offence` (LIST `s 204(10)(a) the indictable limb`)

§ `Lotteries and games of chance (sections 206 to 209)`

@export Under section 206(1), have I committed one of the offences of running or taking part in a lottery or game of chance?
GIVEN `which of these did I do` IS A `s 206(1) act` @desc Which of the acts listed in section 206(1)(a) to (j) did you do?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 206(1), have I committed one of the offences of running or taking part in a lottery or game of chance` MEANS
    `s 206(1) the person commits the offence` `which of these did I do`

@export Under section 206(1), how serious is an offence under section 206(1), and what can it cost me?
