`Under section 206(1), how serious is an offence under section 206(1), and what can it cost me` MEANS
    `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty of an offence` `s 206(1) the class of the offence` (LIST `s 206(1) the indictable limb`)

@export Under section 206(3), do paragraphs 206(1)(f) and (g) not apply to me because I run a game at a fair or exhibition?
