      `the game is a dice game, three-card monte, punch board or coin table` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the game a dice game, three-card monte, a punch board or a coin table?
      `I am the board of an annual fair or exhibition` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the board of an annual fair or exhibition?
      `I am an operator of a concession leased by that board within its grounds` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you an operator of a concession leased by that board within its own grounds?
      `the game is operated during the fair or exhibition on those grounds` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the game operated during the fair or exhibition on those grounds?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 206(3), do paragraphs 206(1)(f) and (g) not apply to me because I run a game at a fair or exhibition` MEANS
    `s 206(3) paragraphs (1)(f) and (g) do not apply to the person` `which of these did I do` `the game is a dice game, three-card monte, punch board or coin table` `I am the board of an annual fair or exhibition` `I am an operator of a concession leased by that board within its grounds` `the game is operated during the fair or exhibition on those grounds`

@export Under section 206(4), have I committed the offence of buying or receiving a lottery ticket?
