GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 206(4), have I committed the offence of buying or receiving a lottery ticket` MEANS
    `s 206(4) the person commits the offence` `I bought, took or received a lot, ticket or other device mentioned in section 206(1)`

