    `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty of an offence` `s 206(4) the class of the offence` EMPTY

@export Under section 206(8), does section 206 not apply to what I did?
GIVEN `it is the division by lot or chance of property by joint tenants, tenants in common or others with joint interests in it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the division by lot or chance of property by joint tenants or tenants in common, or by people having joint interests in the property?
      `it is bonds, debentures or other securities recallable by drawing of lots and redeemable with interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it bonds, debentures, debenture stock or other securities that can be recalled by drawing lots and are redeemable with interest, with premiums payable on redemption or otherwise?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 206(8), does section 206 not apply to what I did` MEANS
    `s 206(8) section 206 does not apply to the thing` `it is the division by lot or chance of property by joint tenants, tenants in common or others with joint interests in it` `it is bonds, debentures or other securities recallable by drawing of lots and redeemable with interest`

@export Under section 207(1), is it lawful for my charity or religious organization to run a lottery scheme?
GIVEN `I am a charitable or religious organization` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a charitable or religious organization?
      `I act under a licence issued by the Lieutenant Governor in Council of the province or the person or authority he specifies` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you act under a licence issued by the Lieutenant Governor in Council of the province, or by a person or authority he specifies?
      `I run the scheme in that province` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you conduct and manage the lottery scheme in that province?
      `the proceeds are used for a charitable or religious object or purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the proceeds of the lottery scheme used for a charitable or religious object or purpose?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 207(1), is it lawful for my charity or religious organization to run a lottery scheme` MEANS
    `s 207(1)(b) makes it lawful for a charitable or religious organization to conduct and manage a lottery scheme` `I am a charitable or religious organization` `I act under a licence issued by the Lieutenant Governor in Council of the province or the person or authority he specifies` `I run the scheme in that province` `the proceeds are used for a charitable or religious object or purpose`

@export Under section 207(3), have I committed the offence of running or taking part in an unlawful lottery scheme?
GIVEN `I did something for the purposes of a lottery scheme` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you conduct, manage or operate, or take part in, a lottery scheme?
      `section 207 authorizes it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is what you did authorized by or under a provision of section 207?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 207(3), have I committed the offence of running or taking part in an unlawful lottery scheme` MEANS
    `s 207(3) the person commits the offence` `I did something for the purposes of a lottery scheme` `section 207 authorizes it`

@export Under section 207(3), how serious is an unlawful lottery scheme offence under section 207(3), and what can it cost me?
GIVEN `which of these am I` IS A `s 207(3) role` @desc Did you conduct, manage or operate the lottery scheme, or only take part in it?
GIVETH A `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty`
`Under section 207(3), how serious is an unlawful lottery scheme offence under section 207(3), and what can it cost me` MEANS
    `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty of an offence` (`s 207(3) the class of the offence` `which of these am I`) `the limbs for the role`
        WHERE
            `the limbs for the role` MEANS
                CONSIDER `which of these am I`
                    WHEN `s 207(3)(a) the person conducts, manages or operates the lottery scheme` THEN LIST `s 207(3)(a)(i) the indictable limb`
                    WHEN `s 207(3)(b) the person participates in the lottery scheme` THEN EMPTY

@export Under section 207.1(3), have I committed the offence of running or taking part in an unlawful lottery scheme on a cruise ship?
GIVEN `I did something for the purpose of a lottery scheme on a cruise ship voyage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you conduct, manage or operate, or take part in, a lottery scheme on an international cruise ship?
      `section 207.1 authorizes it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is what you did authorized by section 207.1?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 207.1(3), have I committed the offence of running or taking part in an unlawful lottery scheme on a cruise ship` MEANS
    `s 207.1(3) the person commits the offence` `I did something for the purpose of a lottery scheme on a cruise ship voyage` `section 207.1 authorizes it`

@export Under section 207.1(3), how serious is an unlawful lottery scheme offence on a cruise ship under section 207.1(3), and what can it cost me?
GIVEN `which of these am I` IS A `s 207.1(3) role` @desc Did you conduct, manage or operate the lottery scheme, or only take part in it?
GIVETH A `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty`
`Under section 207.1(3), how serious is an unlawful lottery scheme offence on a cruise ship under section 207.1(3), and what can it cost me` MEANS
    `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty of an offence` (`s 207.1(3) the class of the offence` `which of these am I`) `the limbs for the role`
        WHERE
            `the limbs for the role` MEANS
                CONSIDER `which of these am I`
                    WHEN `s 207.1(3)(a) the person conducts, manages or operates the lottery scheme` THEN LIST `s 207.1(3)(a)(i) the indictable limb`
                    WHEN `s 207.1(3)(b) the person participates in the lottery scheme` THEN EMPTY

@export Under section 209, have I committed the offence of cheating at play?
