    `s 213(1.1) the person commits the offence` `I communicated with a person` `it was for the purpose of offering or providing sexual services for consideration` (`s 213(2) public place` `the public have access to the place as of right or by invitation` `the place is a motor vehicle located in a public place or place open to public view`) `the place is or is next to a school ground, playground or daycare centre`

@export Under section 213(1.1), how serious is the offence under section 213(1.1), and what can it cost me?
GIVETH A `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty`
