§ `Organ trafficking and suicide (sections 240.1 to 241)`

@export Under section 240.1(1), have I committed the offence of an organ removal without informed consent?
GIVEN `which of these did I do` IS A `s 240.1(1) act` @desc Which of these did you do: obtain an organ to be transplanted, carry out, take part in or help with the removal of an organ from another person, or do something in connection with a removal on behalf of, at the direction of or in association with the person who removes it?
      `I knew that the person, or someone authorized to consent for them, did not give informed consent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know that the person from whom the organ was removed (or someone lawfully authorized to consent for them) did not give informed consent to the removal?
      `I was reckless as to whether such consent was given` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you reckless as to whether such consent was given?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 240.1(1), have I committed the offence of an organ removal without informed consent` MEANS
    `s 240.1(1) the person commits the offence of an organ removal without informed consent` `which of these did I do` `I knew that the person, or someone authorized to consent for them, did not give informed consent` `I was reckless as to whether such consent was given`

@export Under section 240.1(2), have I committed the offence of obtaining an organ for consideration?
GIVEN `I obtained, or took part in or helped with the obtaining of, an organ from another person for transplant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you obtain, or take part in or facilitate the obtaining of, an organ from the body of another person so that it could be transplanted into your body or another person's?
      `I knew that it was obtained for consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know that it was obtained for consideration?
      `I was reckless as to whether it was obtained for consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you reckless as to whether it was obtained for consideration?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 240.1(2), have I committed the offence of obtaining an organ for consideration` MEANS
    `s 240.1(2) the person commits the offence of obtaining an organ for consideration` `I obtained, or took part in or helped with the obtaining of, an organ from another person for transplant` `I knew that it was obtained for consideration` `I was reckless as to whether it was obtained for consideration`

