      `I aided a person to die by suicide` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether or not suicide ensued, did you aid a person to die by suicide?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 241(1), have I committed the offence of counselling or aiding suicide` MEANS
    `s 241(1) the person commits the offence` `I counselled or abetted a person to die by suicide` `I aided a person to die by suicide`

@export Under section 241(1), how serious is counselling or aiding suicide, and what can it cost me?
