@export Under section 241.3, have I committed the offence of failing to comply with the safeguards for medical assistance in dying?
GIVEN `I knowingly failed to comply with the safeguards in providing medical assistance in dying` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In providing medical assistance in dying, did you knowingly fail to comply with the safeguards of section 241.2?
