      `I was pregnant and about to be delivered` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you pregnant and about to be delivered?
      `I acted with intent that the child should not live` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent that the child should not live?
      `I acted with intent to conceal the birth of the child` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent to conceal the birth of the child?
      `I failed to make provision for reasonable assistance in respect of my delivery` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fail to make provision for reasonable assistance in respect of your delivery?
      `the child was permanently injured as a result of the failure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the child permanently injured as a result of the failure?
      `the child died immediately before, during or in a short time after birth, as a result of the failure` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the child die immediately before, during or in a short time after birth, as a result of the failure?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 242, have I committed the offence of neglecting to obtain assistance in childbirth` MEANS
    `s 242 the female person commits the offence of neglecting to obtain assistance in childbirth` `I am a female person` `I was pregnant and about to be delivered` `I acted with intent that the child should not live` `I acted with intent to conceal the birth of the child` `I failed to make provision for reasonable assistance in respect of my delivery` `the child was permanently injured as a result of the failure` `the child died immediately before, during or in a short time after birth, as a result of the failure`

@export Under section 242, how serious is neglecting to obtain assistance in childbirth, and what can it cost me?
GIVETH A `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty`
