@export Under section 267, have I committed the offence of assault with a weapon or causing bodily harm?
GIVEN `I committed an assault` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you commit an assault? (See the question under section 265(1).)
      `the thing was used, designed or intended to cause death or injury to a person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing used, designed to be used or intended for use in causing death or injury to any person?
      `the thing was used, designed or intended to threaten or intimidate a person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing used, designed to be used or intended for use for the purpose of threatening or intimidating any person?
      `the thing was used, designed or intended to bind or tie up a person against their will` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing used, designed to be used or intended for use in binding or tying up a person against their will?
      `the thing is a barrelled weapon from which a projectile can be discharged` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing a barrelled weapon from which any shot, bullet or other projectile can be discharged?
      `the thing is capable of causing serious bodily injury or death` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it capable of causing serious bodily injury or death to a person?
      `the thing is a frame or receiver of such a barrelled weapon` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a frame or receiver of such a barrelled weapon?
      `the thing can be adapted for use as a firearm` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can it be adapted for use as a firearm?
      `I carried, used or threatened to use an imitation of a weapon` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In committing it, did you carry, use or threaten to use an imitation of a weapon?
      `I caused bodily harm to the complainant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In committing it, did you cause hurt or injury to the complainant?
      `there was a hurt or injury to a person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was there a hurt or injury to a person?
      `the hurt or injury interferes with the person's health or comfort` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the hurt or injury interfere with the person's health or comfort?
      `the hurt or injury is more than merely transient or trifling` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the hurt or injury more than merely transient or trifling in nature?
      `I choked, suffocated or strangled the complainant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc In committing it, did you choke, suffocate or strangle the complainant?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 267, have I committed the offence of assault with a weapon or causing bodily harm` MEANS
    `s 267 the person commits the offence of assault with a weapon or causing bodily harm` (JUST `I committed an assault`) (`s 2 weapon` `the thing was used, designed or intended to cause death or injury to a person` `the thing was used, designed or intended to threaten or intimidate a person` (`s 2 firearm` `the thing is a barrelled weapon from which a projectile can be discharged` `the thing is capable of causing serious bodily injury or death` `the thing is a frame or receiver of such a barrelled weapon` `the thing can be adapted for use as a firearm`) `the thing was used, designed or intended to bind or tie up a person against their will` TRUE) `I carried, used or threatened to use an imitation of a weapon` (IF `I caused bodily harm to the complainant` THEN (`s 2 bodily harm` `there was a hurt or injury to a person` `the hurt or injury interferes with the person's health or comfort` `the hurt or injury is more than merely transient or trifling`) ELSE JUST FALSE) `I choked, suffocated or strangled the complainant`

@export Under section 267, how serious is assault with a weapon or causing bodily harm, and what can it cost me?
