DECIDE `Under section 276.03(1), is publishing, broadcasting or transmitting the matter prohibited` IS
    `s 276.03(1) the publication, broadcast or transmission of the matter is prohibited` `the matter` `the judge has ordered that it may be published, broadcast or transmitted` `the determination is that the evidence is admissible` (`s 276.03(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `the exception facts`)
    WHERE
        `the exception facts` MEANS `s 276.03(1.1) facts` WITH
