      `the act is committed with intent to destroy in whole or in part any identifiable group` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the act is committed with intent to destroy in whole or in part any identifiable group?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 318(2), is the act genocide` IS
    `s 318(2) the act is genocide` `the act is killing members of the group` `the act is deliberately inflicting on the group conditions of life calculated to bring about its physical destruction` `the act is committed with intent to destroy in whole or in part any identifiable group`

