      `the person publishes or threatens to publish a defamatory libel` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person publishes or threatens to publish a defamatory libel?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 302(3), am I guilty of the offence for committing an offence under section 302` IS
    `s 302(3) the person who commits an offence under this section is guilty of the offence` (`s 302(1) the person commits the offence of extortion by libel` `the person acts with intent to extort money from any person` `the person acts with intent to induce a person to confer on or procure for another person an appointment or office of profit or trust` `the person publishes or threatens to publish or offers to abstain from publishing or to prevent the publication of a defamatory libel`) (`s 302(2) the person commits the offence of publishing a libel after a refusal` `the person acts as the result of the refusal of any person to permit money to be extorted or to confer or procure an appointment or office of profit or trust` `the person publishes or threatens to publish a defamatory libel`)

@export Under section 302(3), what punishment am I liable to for an offence under section 302?
GIVEN `mode` IS A `Mode of proceeding` @desc Is the case being prosecuted by indictment, or on summary conviction?
      `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment @desc What is the general penalty that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction?
GIVETH A Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 302(3), what punishment am I liable to for an offence under section 302` IS
    `s 302(3) the punishment` `mode` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`

@export Under section 303(1), as the proprietor of a newspaper, am I deemed to publish the defamatory matter inserted and published in it?
