@export Under section 303(2), is the insertion deemed not to be negligence on my part as the proprietor?
GIVEN `the proprietor of a newspaper gave a person general authority to manage or conduct the newspaper as editor or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the proprietor of a newspaper gave a person general authority to manage or conduct the newspaper as editor or otherwise?
