    `s 303(2) the insertion is deemed not to be negligence on the part of the proprietor` `the proprietor of a newspaper gave a person general authority to manage or conduct the newspaper as editor or otherwise` `that person inserted defamatory matter in the newspaper` `it is proved that the proprietor intended the general authority to include authority to insert defamatory matter in the newspaper` `it is proved that the proprietor continued to confer general authority after he knew that it had been exercised by the insertion of defamatory matter in the newspaper`

