@export Under section 307, am I not deemed to publish a defamatory libel by reason only of publishing the fair report or fair comment, after subsection (2)?
GIVEN `the person publishes in good faith, for the information of the public, a fair report of the proceedings of the Senate or House of Commons or the legislature of a province, or a committee thereof, or of the public proceedings before a court exercising judicial authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person publishes in good faith, for the information of the public, a fair report of the proceedings of the Senate or House of Commons or the legislature of a province, or a committee thereof, or of the public proceedings before a court exercising judicial authority?
      `the person publishes, in good faith, any fair comment on any such proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person publishes, in good faith, any fair comment on any such proceedings?
      `the person publishes a report of evidence taken or offered in any proceeding before the Senate or House of Commons or any committee thereof, on a petition or bill relating to any matter of marriage or divorce` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person publishes a report of evidence taken or offered in any proceeding before the Senate or House of Commons or any committee thereof, on a petition or bill relating to any matter of marriage or divorce?
      `the report is published without authority from or leave of the House in which the proceeding is held` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the report is published without authority from or leave of the House in which the proceeding is held?
      `the report is published contrary to any rule, order or practice of that House` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the report is published contrary to any rule, order or practice of that House?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 307, am I not deemed to publish a defamatory libel by reason only of publishing the fair report or fair comment, after subsection (2)` IS
    `s 307 the person is not deemed to publish a defamatory libel by reason only of publishing the fair report or fair comment, after subsection (2)` (`s 307(1) the person is not deemed to publish a defamatory libel by reason only of publishing the fair report or fair comment` `the person publishes in good faith, for the information of the public, a fair report of the proceedings of the Senate or House of Commons or the legislature of a province, or a committee thereof, or of the public proceedings before a court exercising judicial authority` `the person publishes, in good faith, any fair comment on any such proceedings`) (`s 307(2) section 307 does not apply to the person who publishes the report` `the person publishes a report of evidence taken or offered in any proceeding before the Senate or House of Commons or any committee thereof, on a petition or bill relating to any matter of marriage or divorce` `the report is published without authority from or leave of the House in which the proceeding is held` `the report is published contrary to any rule, order or practice of that House`)

