DECIDE `Under section 317, may the jury give a general verdict of guilty or not guilty on the whole matter put in issue on the indictment` IS
    `s 317 the jury may give a general verdict of guilty or not guilty on the whole matter put in issue on the indictment` `on the trial of an indictment for publishing a defamatory libel, a plea of not guilty is pleaded` `the jury is sworn to try the issue`

