      `the disclosure is made in the course of the administration of justice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make the disclosure in the course of the administration of justice?
      `the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known in the community` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your purpose was not to make the information known in the community?
      `the person who made the disclosure is the complainant` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you the complainant (the person against whom the offence is alleged to have been committed)?
      `the person who made the disclosure is a witness` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a witness (in the proceedings, on the application for records)?
      `the disclosure is about that complainant or witness and their particulars` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the disclosure about you as the complainant or witness, and your own particulars?
      `they did not intentionally or recklessly reveal the identity of or particulars likely to identify any other person whose identity is protected by this section` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you did not intentionally or recklessly reveal the identity of, or particulars likely to identify, any other person whose identity is protected by the section?
      `the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known to the public` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that your purpose was not to make the information known to the public?
