    `s 278.32(2) the person is guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction` `the person published, broadcast or transmitted the matter` (`s 278.32(1) publication of the matter is prohibited` `matter` (JUST `an application for a hearing on records in the accused’s possession has been made`) `the judge, provincial court judge or justice has ordered that it may be published, broadcast or transmitted` `the determination is that evidence is admissible`) (`s 278.32(1.1) subsection (1) does not apply to the disclosure` `the information is referred to in paragraphs (1)(a) to (d)` `the disclosure is made in the course of the administration of justice` `the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known in the community` (`s 278.32(1.1) the disclosure is made by the complainant or any witness` (JUST `the person who made the disclosure is the complainant`) `the person who made the disclosure is a witness`) `the disclosure is about that complainant or witness and their particulars` `they did not intentionally or recklessly reveal the identity of or particulars likely to identify any other person whose identity is protected by this section` `the purpose of the disclosure is not one of making the information known to the public`)

@export Under section 278.32(2), what punishment am I liable to?
GIVEN `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment @desc What is the general penalty that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction?
GIVETH A Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 278.32(2), what punishment am I liable to` IS
    `s 278.32(2) the punishment` `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`

@export Under section 278.33, must the judge instruct the jury in my trial as to the uses the jury may and may not make of the evidence?
GIVEN `evidence is admitted at trial on the basis of a determination made under subsection 278.31(4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has evidence been admitted at your trial on the basis of a determination made under section 278.31(4) after a hearing on records?
