@export Under section 286.5(1)(a), am I guilty of the offence of receiving a material benefit from sexual services after the exception of section 286.2(4) and the immunity?
GIVEN `the person receives a financial or other material benefit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person receives a financial or other material benefit?
      `the person knows that it is obtained by or derived directly or indirectly from the commission of an offence under subsection 286.1(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person knows that it is obtained by or derived directly or indirectly from the commission of an offence under subsection 286.1(1)?
      `the person receives the benefit in the context of a legitimate living arrangement with the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person receives the benefit in the context of a legitimate living arrangement with the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived?
      `the person receives the benefit as a result of a legal or moral obligation of the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person receives the benefit as a result of a legal or moral obligation of the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived?
      `the person receives the benefit in consideration for a service or good that they offer, on the same terms and conditions, to the general public` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person receives the benefit in consideration for a service or good that they offer, on the same terms and conditions, to the general public?
      `the person receives the benefit in consideration for a service or good that they do not offer to the general public but that they offered or provided to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person receives the benefit in consideration for a service or good that they do not offer to the general public but that they offered or provided to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived?
      `they did not counsel or encourage that person to provide sexual services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you did not counsel or encourage that person to provide sexual services?
      `the benefit is proportionate to the value of the service or good` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the benefit is proportionate to the value of the service or good?
      `the person commits an offence under subsection (1) or (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person commits an offence under subsection (1) or (2)?
      `the person used, threatened to use or attempted to use violence, intimidation or coercion in relation to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person used, threatened to use or attempted to use violence, intimidation or coercion in relation to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived?
      `the person abused a position of trust, power or authority in relation to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person abused a position of trust, power or authority in relation to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived?
      `the person provided a drug, alcohol or any other intoxicating substance to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived for the purpose of aiding or abetting that person to offer or provide sexual services for consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person provided a drug, alcohol or any other intoxicating substance to the person from whose sexual services the benefit is derived for the purpose of aiding or abetting that person to offer or provide sexual services for consideration?
      `the person engaged in conduct, in relation to any person, that would constitute an offence under section 286.3` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person engaged in conduct, in relation to any person, that would constitute an offence under section 286.3?
      `the person received the benefit in the context of a commercial enterprise that offers sexual services for consideration` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person received the benefit in the context of a commercial enterprise that offers sexual services for consideration?
      `offence` IS A `Provision of the Code` @desc Which provision of the Code creates the offence you are charged with? (give its section number and subsection)
      `the benefit is derived from the provision of their own sexual services` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the benefit is derived from the provision of your own sexual services?
