      `the day on which the spouse’s continuous absence began` IS A DATE @desc On what date did your spouse's continuous absence begin?
      `the day on which the person goes through the form of marriage` IS A DATE @desc On what date did you go through the form of marriage?
      `the person knew that the spouse was alive at any time during those seven years` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person knew that the spouse was alive at any time during those seven years?
      `the person has been divorced from the bond of the first marriage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does this describe you or what you did: the person has been divorced from the bond of the first marriage?
      `the former marriage has been declared void by a court of competent jurisdiction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the former marriage has been declared void by a court of competent jurisdiction?
