DECIDE `Under section 290(2), do I not commit bigamy by going through the form of marriage` IS
    `s 290(2) the person does not commit bigamy by going through the form of marriage` `the person in good faith and on reasonable grounds believes that their spouse is dead` `the day on which the spouse’s continuous absence began` `the day on which the person goes through the form of marriage` `the person knew that the spouse was alive at any time during those seven years` `the person has been divorced from the bond of the first marriage` `the former marriage has been declared void by a court of competent jurisdiction`

