@export Under section 320.18(1), have I committed the offence of operating a conveyance while prohibited from doing so?
GIVEN `my conveyance` IS A STRING @desc What kind of conveyance were you using? Answer exactly one of: motor vehicle, vessel, aircraft, railway equipment, something else
      `how I used it` IS A STRING @desc How did you use it? Answer exactly one of: drove it, navigated it, assisted in navigating it, participated in the direct control of its motion, had care or control of it, none of these
