GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 320.31(7), may the result of the analysis of a sample I was not required to provide be admitted even though I was not warned` IS
    `s 320.31(7) the result of the analysis may be admitted in evidence even if the person was not warned` `I was not required to provide the sample under Part VIII.1`

