@export Under section 320.32(7), am I presumed to have received the notice of the prohibition and to know of it on this day?
GIVEN `it is proved that a prohibition under paragraph 320.18(1)(b) has been imposed on me` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it proved that a prohibition under paragraph 320.18(1)(b) was imposed on you?
