@export Under section 330(1), have I committed theft by failing to account?
GIVEN `Did you receive anything from a person on terms that required you to account for or pay it, or its proceeds or a part of them, to that person or to another` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive anything from a person on terms that required you to account for or pay it, or its proceeds or a part of them, to that person or to another?
      `Did you fraudulently fail to account for or pay it or its proceeds or part of them accordingly` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fraudulently fail to account for or pay it or its proceeds or part of them accordingly?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 330(1), have I committed theft by failing to account` IS
    `s 330(1) the person commits theft by failing to account` WITH
        `the person received anything from any person on terms that require them to account for or pay it or the proceeds of it or a part of the proceeds to that person or another person` IS `Did you receive anything from a person on terms that required you to account for or pay it, or its proceeds or a part of them, to that person or to another`
        `the person fraudulently failed to account for or pay it or the proceeds of it or the part of the proceeds of it accordingly` IS `Did you fraudulently fail to account for or pay it or its proceeds or part of them accordingly`

-- JUST FALSE is the text's no: "no fraudulent conversion ... shall be deemed to have taken place".
@export Under section 330(2), is a fraudulent conversion deemed to have taken place when a proper entry was made in a debtor and creditor account?
GIVEN `Does section 330(1) otherwise apply to you` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does section 330(1) otherwise apply to you?
      `Was one of the terms that the thing or its proceeds would be an item in a debtor and creditor account between you and the person to whom you were to account` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was one of the terms that the thing or its proceeds would be an item in a debtor and creditor account between you and the person to whom you were to account?
      `Was one of the terms that that person would rely only on your liability as debtor` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was one of the terms that that person would rely only on your liability as debtor?
      `Was a proper entry of the thing or its proceeds made in that account` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a proper entry of the thing or its proceeds made in that account?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 330(2), is a fraudulent conversion deemed to have taken place when a proper entry was made in a debtor and creditor account` IS
    `s 330(2) a fraudulent conversion of the thing or the proceeds is deemed to have taken place` WITH
        `subsection 330(1) otherwise applies` IS `Does section 330(1) otherwise apply to you`
        `one of the terms is that the thing received or the proceeds or part of the proceeds of it shall be an item in a debtor and creditor account between the person who receives the thing and the person to whom they are to account for or to pay it` IS `Was one of the terms that the thing or its proceeds would be an item in a debtor and creditor account between you and the person to whom you were to account`
        `one of the terms is that the latter shall rely only on the liability of the other as their debtor in respect of it` IS `Was one of the terms that that person would rely only on your liability as debtor`
        `a proper entry in that account of the thing received or the proceeds or part of the proceeds of it has been made` IS `Was a proper entry of the thing or its proceeds made in that account`

@export Under section 331, have I committed theft by disposing of property held under a power of attorney?
GIVEN `Were you entrusted, alone or with another, with a power of attorney for the sale, mortgage, pledge or other disposition of real or personal property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you entrusted, alone or with another, with a power of attorney for the sale, mortgage, pledge or other disposition of real or personal property?
      `Did you fraudulently sell, mortgage, pledge or otherwise dispose of the property or any part of it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fraudulently sell, mortgage, pledge or otherwise dispose of the property or any part of it?
      `Did you fraudulently convert the proceeds, or any part of them, to a purpose other than the one for which you were entrusted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fraudulently convert the proceeds, or any part of them, to a purpose other than the one for which you were entrusted?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 331, have I committed theft by disposing of property held under a power of attorney` IS
    `s 331 the person commits theft by disposing of property held under a power of attorney` WITH
        `the person was entrusted, whether solely or jointly with another person, with a power of attorney for the sale, mortgage, pledge or other disposition of real or personal property` IS `Were you entrusted, alone or with another, with a power of attorney for the sale, mortgage, pledge or other disposition of real or personal property`
        `the person fraudulently sells, mortgages, pledges or otherwise disposes of the property or any part of it` IS `Did you fraudulently sell, mortgage, pledge or otherwise dispose of the property or any part of it`
        `the person fraudulently converts the proceeds of a sale, mortgage, pledge or other disposition of the property, or any part of the proceeds, to a purpose other than that for which they were entrusted by the power of attorney` IS `Did you fraudulently convert the proceeds, or any part of them, to a purpose other than the one for which you were entrusted`

@export Under section 332(1), have I committed theft by misappropriating money held under direction?
GIVEN `Did you receive, alone or with another, money` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive, alone or with another, money?
      `Did you receive, alone or with another, a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive, alone or with another, a valuable security?
      `Did you receive, alone or with another, a power of attorney for the sale of real or personal property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive, alone or with another, a power of attorney for the sale of real or personal property?
      `Did you receive it with a direction that the money, or the proceeds, or a part of them, be applied to a purpose or paid to a person the direction named` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive it with a direction that the money, or the proceeds, or a part of them, be applied to a purpose or paid to a person the direction named?
      `Did you fraudulently, and contrary to the direction, apply any of it to another purpose or pay it to another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you fraudulently, and contrary to the direction, apply any of it to another purpose or pay it to another person?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 332(1), have I committed theft by misappropriating money held under direction` IS
    `s 332(1) the person commits theft by misappropriating money held under direction` WITH
        `the person received, either solely or jointly with another person, money` IS `Did you receive, alone or with another, money`
        `the person received, either solely or jointly with another person, a valuable security, by s 2 valuable security` IS (JUST `Did you receive, alone or with another, a valuable security`)
        `the person received, either solely or jointly with another person, a power of attorney for the sale of real or personal property` IS `Did you receive, alone or with another, a power of attorney for the sale of real or personal property`
        `the person received it with a direction that the money or a part of it, or the proceeds or a part of the proceeds of the security or the property, shall be applied to a purpose or paid to a person specified in the direction` IS `Did you receive it with a direction that the money, or the proceeds, or a part of them, be applied to a purpose or paid to a person the direction named`
        `the person fraudulently and contrary to the direction applied the money or proceeds or any part of it to any other purpose or paid it to any other person` IS `Did you fraudulently, and contrary to the direction, apply any of it to another purpose or pay it to another person`

