@export Under section 335(1.1), does section 335(1) apply to me as an occupant who attempted to leave or left?
GIVEN `Were you an occupant of a motor vehicle or vessel` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you an occupant of a motor vehicle or vessel?
      `On becoming aware that it was taken without the owner's consent, did you attempt to leave it, as far as it was feasible to do so` IS A BOOLEAN @desc On becoming aware that it was taken without the owner's consent, did you attempt to leave it, as far as it was feasible to do so?
      `On becoming aware that it was taken without the owner's consent, did you actually leave it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc On becoming aware that it was taken without the owner's consent, did you actually leave it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 335(1.1), does section 335(1) apply to me as an occupant who attempted to leave or left` IS
    `s 335(1.1) subsection (1) applies to an occupant` WITH
        `the person is an occupant of a motor vehicle or vessel` IS `Were you an occupant of a motor vehicle or vessel`
        `on becoming aware that it was taken without the consent of the owner, the occupant attempted to leave it, to the extent that it was feasible to do so` IS `On becoming aware that it was taken without the owner's consent, did you attempt to leave it, as far as it was feasible to do so`
        `on becoming aware that it was taken without the consent of the owner, the occupant actually left it` IS `On becoming aware that it was taken without the owner's consent, did you actually leave it`

