@export Under section 336, have I committed criminal breach of trust?
GIVEN `Are you a trustee (see section 2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you a trustee (see section 2)?
      `Was the thing held for the use or benefit, in whole or in part, of another person, or for a public or charitable purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the thing held for the use or benefit, in whole or in part, of another person, or for a public or charitable purpose?
      `Did you convert it or any part of it to a use that is not authorized by the trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you convert it or any part of it to a use that is not authorized by the trust?
      `Did you do so with intent to defraud and in contravention of the trust` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do so with intent to defraud and in contravention of the trust?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 336, have I committed criminal breach of trust` IS
    `s 336 the person commits criminal breach of trust` WITH
        `the person is a trustee, by s 2 trustee` IS (JUST `Are you a trustee (see section 2)`)
        `the thing is held for the use or benefit, whether in whole or in part, of another person, or for a public or charitable purpose` IS `Was the thing held for the use or benefit, in whole or in part, of another person, or for a public or charitable purpose`
        `the person converted that thing or any part of it to a use that is not authorized by the trust` IS `Did you convert it or any part of it to a use that is not authorized by the trust`
        `the person did so with intent to defraud and in contravention of the trust` IS `Did you do so with intent to defraud and in contravention of the trust`

