      `Did you refuse to deliver it up to the owner, the person in charge of it for the owner, or a person the owner authorized to receive it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you refuse to deliver it up to the owner, the person in charge of it for the owner, or a person the owner authorized to receive it?
