    `s 342.1(1) the person commits the offence of unauthorized use of a computer` WITH
        `the person acted fraudulently and without colour of right` IS `Did you act fraudulently and without colour of right`
        `the person obtains, directly or indirectly, any computer service` IS `Did you obtain, directly or indirectly, any computer service`
        `the person, by means of an electro-magnetic, acoustic, mechanical or other device, intercepts or causes to be intercepted, directly or indirectly, any function of a computer system` IS `Did you, by means of an electro-magnetic, acoustic, mechanical or other device, intercept or cause to be intercepted, directly or indirectly, any function of a computer system`
        `the person uses or causes to be used, directly or indirectly, a computer system with intent to commit an offence under paragraph (a) or (b) or under section 430 in relation to computer data or a computer system` IS `Did you use or cause to be used, directly or indirectly, a computer system with intent to commit an offence under paragraph (a) or (b) or under section 430 in relation to computer data or a computer system`
        `the person uses, possesses, traffics in or permits another person to have access to a computer password that would enable a person to commit an offence under paragraph (a), (b) or (c)` IS `Did you use, possess, traffic in or permit another person to have access to a computer password that would enable a person to commit an offence under paragraph (a), (b) or (c)`

@export Under section 342.1(1), what is the most I can be sentenced to?
GIVEN `What is the greatest fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the greatest fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction?
      `What is the longest term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the longest term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(1), what is the most I can be sentenced to` IS
    `s 342.1(1) the punishment for the offence` WITH
        `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS (`ccc12 seat the general penalty of s 787(1) as the person states it` `What is the greatest fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `What is the longest term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction`)

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it "computer data"?
GIVEN `Is it representations, including signs, signals or symbols` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it representations, including signs, signals or symbols?
      `Are they in a form suitable for processing in a computer system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are they in a form suitable for processing in a computer system?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it "computer data"` IS
    `s 342.1(2) computer data` WITH
        `it is representations, including signs, signals or symbols` IS `Is it representations, including signs, signals or symbols`
        `it is in a form suitable for processing in a computer system` IS `Are they in a form suitable for processing in a computer system`

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer password"?
GIVEN `Is it computer data (see section 342.1(2))` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it computer data (see section 342.1(2))?
      `Is it something by which a computer service or computer system is capable of being obtained or used` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it something by which a computer service or computer system is capable of being obtained or used?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer password"` IS
    `s 342.1(2) computer password` WITH
        `it is computer data, by s 342.1(2) computer data` IS (JUST `Is it computer data (see section 342.1(2))`)
        `by it a computer service or computer system is capable of being obtained or used` IS `Is it something by which a computer service or computer system is capable of being obtained or used`

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer program"?
GIVEN `Is it computer data (see section 342.1(2))` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it computer data (see section 342.1(2))?
      `Does it represent instructions or statements` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it represent instructions or statements?
      `When executed in a computer system, does it cause the computer system to perform a function` IS A BOOLEAN @desc When executed in a computer system, does it cause the computer system to perform a function?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer program"` IS
    `s 342.1(2) computer program` WITH
        `it is computer data, by s 342.1(2) computer data` IS (JUST `Is it computer data (see section 342.1(2))`)
        `it represents instructions or statements` IS `Does it represent instructions or statements`
        `when executed in a computer system it causes the computer system to perform a function` IS `When executed in a computer system, does it cause the computer system to perform a function`

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer service"?
GIVEN `What is it: data processing, the storage of computer data, the retrieval of computer data, or another service` IS A `s 342.1(2) computer service kind` @desc What is it: data processing, the storage of computer data, the retrieval of computer data, or another service?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer service"` IS
    `s 342.1(2) computer service` WITH
        `kind` IS `What is it: data processing, the storage of computer data, the retrieval of computer data, or another service`

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer system"?
GIVEN `Is it a device, or a group of interconnected or related devices one or more of which does the following` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a device, or a group of interconnected or related devices one or more of which does the following?
      `Does it contain computer programs or other computer data` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it contain computer programs or other computer data?
      `By means of computer programs, does it perform logic and control` IS A BOOLEAN @desc By means of computer programs, does it perform logic and control?
      `By means of computer programs, may it perform any other function` IS A BOOLEAN @desc By means of computer programs, may it perform any other function?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it a "computer system"` IS
    `s 342.1(2) computer system` WITH
        `it is a device, or a group of interconnected or related devices one or more of which` IS `Is it a device, or a group of interconnected or related devices one or more of which does the following`
        `it contains computer programs or other computer data` IS `Does it contain computer programs or other computer data`
        `by means of computer programs it performs logic and control` IS `By means of computer programs, does it perform logic and control`
        `by means of computer programs it may perform any other function` IS `By means of computer programs, may it perform any other function`

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it an "electro-magnetic, acoustic, mechanical or other device"?
GIVEN `Is it a device or apparatus` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a device or apparatus?
      `Is it used or capable of being used to intercept any function of a computer system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it used or capable of being used to intercept any function of a computer system?
      `Is it a hearing aid used to correct subnormal hearing of the user to not better than normal hearing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a hearing aid used to correct subnormal hearing of the user to not better than normal hearing?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it an "electro-magnetic, acoustic, mechanical or other device"` IS
    `s 342.1(2) electro-magnetic, acoustic, mechanical or other device` WITH
        `it is a device or apparatus` IS `Is it a device or apparatus`
        `it is used or is capable of being used to intercept any function of a computer system` IS `Is it used or capable of being used to intercept any function of a computer system`
        `it is a hearing aid used to correct subnormal hearing of the user to not better than normal hearing` IS `Is it a hearing aid used to correct subnormal hearing of the user to not better than normal hearing`

@export Under section 342.1(2), is it a "function" of a computer system?
GIVEN `What is it: logic, control, arithmetic, deletion, storage and retrieval, communication or telecommunication to, from or within a computer system, or another function` IS A `s 342.1(2) function kind` @desc What is it: logic, control, arithmetic, deletion, storage and retrieval, communication or telecommunication to, from or within a computer system, or another function?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), is it a "function" of a computer system` IS
    `s 342.1(2) function` WITH
        `kind` IS `What is it: logic, control, arithmetic, deletion, storage and retrieval, communication or telecommunication to, from or within a computer system, or another function`

@export Under section 342.1(2), did I "intercept" a function of a computer system?
GIVEN `What did you do: listen to a function of a computer system, record it, acquire its substance, meaning or purport, or another act` IS A `s 342.1(2) intercept kind` @desc What did you do: listen to a function of a computer system, record it, acquire its substance, meaning or purport, or another act?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), did I "intercept" a function of a computer system` IS
    `s 342.1(2) intercept` WITH
        `kind` IS `What did you do: listen to a function of a computer system, record it, acquire its substance, meaning or purport, or another act`

@export Under section 342.1(2), do I "traffic" in a computer password?
GIVEN `Did you sell, export from or import into Canada, distribute or deal with in any other way the computer password` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you sell, export from or import into Canada, distribute or deal with in any other way the computer password?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.1(2), do I "traffic" in a computer password` IS
    `s 342.1(2) the person traffics in the computer password` WITH
        `the person sells, exports from or imports into Canada, distributes or deals with in any other way the computer password` IS `Did you sell, export from or import into Canada, distribute or deal with in any other way the computer password`

@export Under section 342.2(1), have I committed the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief?
GIVEN `Did you act without lawful excuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act without lawful excuse?
      `Did you make, possess, sell, offer for sale, import, obtain for use, distribute or make available the thing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make, possess, sell, offer for sale, import, obtain for use, distribute or make available the thing?
      `Is the thing a device (including a component of a device, or a computer program as section 342.1(2) defines it)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing a device (including a component of a device, or a computer program as section 342.1(2) defines it)?
      `Is the device designed or adapted primarily to commit an offence under section 342.1 or 430` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the device designed or adapted primarily to commit an offence under section 342.1 or 430?
      `Do you know that the device has been used or is intended to be used to commit such an offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you know that the device has been used or is intended to be used to commit such an offence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.2(1), have I committed the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` IS
    `s 342.2(1) the person commits the offence of possessing a device to obtain unauthorized use of a computer system or to commit mischief` WITH
        `the person acted without lawful excuse` IS `Did you act without lawful excuse`
        `the person makes, possesses, sells, offers for sale, imports, obtains for use, distributes or makes available the thing` IS `Did you make, possess, sell, offer for sale, import, obtain for use, distribute or make available the thing`
        `the thing is a device, by s 342.2(4) the thing is a device` IS (JUST `Is the thing a device (including a component of a device, or a computer program as section 342.1(2) defines it)`)
        `the device is designed or adapted primarily to commit an offence under section 342.1 or 430` IS `Is the device designed or adapted primarily to commit an offence under section 342.1 or 430`
        `the person knows that the device has been used or is intended to be used to commit such an offence` IS `Do you know that the device has been used or is intended to be used to commit such an offence`

@export Under section 342.2(1), what is the most I can be sentenced to?
GIVEN `What is the greatest fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the greatest fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction?
      `What is the longest term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the longest term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 342.2(1), what is the most I can be sentenced to` IS
    `s 342.2(1) the punishment for the offence` WITH
        `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS (`ccc12 seat the general penalty of s 787(1) as the person states it` `What is the greatest fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `What is the longest term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) provides for an offence punishable on summary conviction`)

@export Under section 342.2(2), may the court order the device forfeited to Her Majesty?
GIVEN `Have you been convicted of an offence under section 342.2(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you been convicted of an offence under section 342.2(1)?
      `Is it a device in relation to which the offence was committed, or the possession of which constituted the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a device in relation to which the offence was committed, or the possession of which constituted the offence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.2(2), may the court order the device forfeited to Her Majesty` IS
    `s 342.2(2) the device may be ordered forfeited to Her Majesty` WITH
        `the person is convicted of an offence under subsection 342.2(1)` IS `Have you been convicted of an offence under section 342.2(1)`
        `the device is one in relation to which the offence was committed, or the possession of which constituted the offence` IS `Is it a device in relation to which the offence was committed, or the possession of which constituted the offence`

@export Under section 342.2(3), is an order forfeiting the device barred because it belongs to a person who was not a party to the offence?
GIVEN `Is the thing the property of a person who was not a party to the offence under section 342.2(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing the property of a person who was not a party to the offence under section 342.2(1)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.2(3), is an order forfeiting the device barred because it belongs to a person who was not a party to the offence` IS
    `s 342.2(3) an order of forfeiture is barred` WITH
        `the thing is the property of a person who was not a party to the offence under subsection 342.2(1)` IS `Is the thing the property of a person who was not a party to the offence under section 342.2(1)`

@export Under section 342.2(4), is the thing a "device"?
GIVEN `Is it a component of a device` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a component of a device?
      `Is it a computer program within the meaning of section 342.1(2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a computer program within the meaning of section 342.1(2)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 342.2(4), is the thing a "device"` IS
    `s 342.2(4) the thing is a device` WITH
        `it is a component of a device` IS `Is it a component of a device`
        `it is a computer program within the meaning of subsection 342.1(2), by s 342.1(2) computer program` IS (JUST `Is it a computer program within the meaning of section 342.1(2)`)


§ `Sections 343 to 346.1 -- robbery and extortion`
-- Robbery, stopping mail and extortion, and how an earlier offence is counted. The questions on earlier offences (344(2), (3), 346(1.2), (1.3)) and on the court's duties (346(1.4), 346.1) arise only when sentence is to be imposed.

@export Under section 343, have I committed robbery?
GIVEN `Did you steal (commit theft: see section 322)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you steal (commit theft: see section 322)?
      `For the purpose of extorting whatever was stolen, or to prevent or overcome resistance to the stealing, did you use violence or threats of violence to a person or property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc For the purpose of extorting whatever was stolen, or to prevent or overcome resistance to the stealing, did you use violence or threats of violence to a person or property?
      `Did you steal from a person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you steal from a person?
      `At the time you stole, or immediately before or after, did you wound, beat, strike or use any personal violence to that person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc At the time you stole, or immediately before or after, did you wound, beat, strike or use any personal violence to that person?
      `Did you assault a person with intent to steal from them` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you assault a person with intent to steal from them?
      `Were you armed with an offensive weapon (see section 2) while stealing from a person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you armed with an offensive weapon (see section 2) while stealing from a person?
      `Were you armed with an imitation of an offensive weapon` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Were you armed with an imitation of an offensive weapon?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 343, have I committed robbery` IS
    `s 343 the person commits robbery` WITH
        `the person steals, by s 2 steal` IS (`s 2 steal` (JUST `Did you steal (commit theft: see section 322)`))
        `the person, for the purpose of extorting whatever is stolen or to prevent or overcome resistance to the stealing, uses violence or threats of violence to a person or property` IS `For the purpose of extorting whatever was stolen, or to prevent or overcome resistance to the stealing, did you use violence or threats of violence to a person or property`
        `the person steals from any person` IS `Did you steal from a person`
        `at the time the person steals or immediately before or immediately thereafter, the person wounds, beats, strikes or uses any personal violence to that person` IS `At the time you stole, or immediately before or after, did you wound, beat, strike or use any personal violence to that person`
        `the person assaults any person with intent to steal from them` IS `Did you assault a person with intent to steal from them`
        `the person is armed with an offensive weapon, by s 2 offensive weapon` IS (JUST `Were you armed with an offensive weapon (see section 2) while stealing from a person`)
        `the person is armed with an imitation of an offensive weapon` IS `Were you armed with an imitation of an offensive weapon`

@export Under section 344(1), if I am convicted of robbery, what is the most and the least I can be sentenced to?
GIVEN `Was a restricted firearm used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a restricted firearm used in the commission of the offence?
      `Was a prohibited firearm used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a prohibited firearm used in the commission of the offence?
      `Was any firearm used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was any firearm used in the commission of the offence?
      `Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization?
      `Is the group a criminal organization (see section 467.1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the group a criminal organization (see section 467.1)?
      `Is it a second or subsequent offence (see subsection (2) or (1.2))` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a second or subsequent offence (see subsection (2) or (1.2))?
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF Punishment)
DECIDE `Under section 344(1), if I am convicted of robbery, what is the most and the least I can be sentenced to` IS
    `s 344(1) the punishment for robbery` WITH
        `a restricted firearm is used in the commission of the offence, by s 2.1 restricted firearm` IS (JUST `Was a restricted firearm used in the commission of the offence`)
        `a prohibited firearm is used in the commission of the offence, by s 2.1 prohibited firearm` IS (JUST `Was a prohibited firearm used in the commission of the offence`)
        `any firearm is used in the commission of the offence, by s 2 firearm` IS (JUST `Was any firearm used in the commission of the offence`)
        `the offence is committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization` IS `Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization`
        `the group is a criminal organization, by s 2 criminal organization` IS (JUST `Is the group a criminal organization (see section 467.1)`)
        `the offence is a second or subsequent offence, by s 344(2)` IS `Is it a second or subsequent offence (see subsection (2) or (1.2))`

@export Under section 344(2), does my earlier conviction count as an earlier offence for section 344(1)?
GIVEN `What is the number of the section of the Code that the earlier offence was under` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of the section of the Code that the earlier offence was under?
      `What is the subsection, if any (for example "(1)"), or "" if none` IS A STRING @desc What is the subsection, if any (for example "(1)"), or "" if none?
      `Was a firearm used in the commission of the earlier offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a firearm used in the commission of the earlier offence?
      `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the day of the month (1 to 31) of your conviction for the earlier offence?
      `What is the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the month (1 to 12) of your conviction for the earlier offence?
      `What is the year of your conviction for the earlier offence` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the year of your conviction for the earlier offence?
      `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the day of the month (1 to 31) of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed?
      `What is the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the month (1 to 12) of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed?
      `What is the year of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the year of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed?
      `How many days were you in custody between those two convictions` IS A NUMBER @desc How many days were you in custody between those two convictions?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 344(2), does my earlier conviction count as an earlier offence for section 344(1)` IS
    `s 344(2) the earlier conviction is considered as an earlier offence` WITH
        `the earlier offence` IS (`Provision of the Code` OF `What is the number of the section of the Code that the earlier offence was under`, `What is the subsection, if any (for example "(1)"), or "" if none`)
        `a firearm was used in the commission of the earlier offence` IS `Was a firearm used in the commission of the earlier offence`
        `ten years have elapsed, by s 344(2) ten years have elapsed between the convictions, not taking into account any time in custody` IS (`s 344(2) ten years have elapsed between the convictions, not taking into account any time in custody` (Date `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` `What is the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` `What is the year of your conviction for the earlier offence`) (Date `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` `What is the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` `What is the year of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed`) `How many days were you in custody between those two convictions`)

@export Under section 344(3), is the matter I describe to be considered when counting earlier offences?
GIVEN `What is it: the sequence of convictions, the sequence of commission of offences, whether an offence occurred before or after a conviction, or any other matter` IS A `s 344(3) matter` @desc What is it: the sequence of convictions, the sequence of commission of offences, whether an offence occurred before or after a conviction, or any other matter?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 344(3), is the matter I describe to be considered when counting earlier offences` IS
    `s 344(3) the matter is to be considered for the purposes of subsection (2)` WITH
        `matter` IS `What is it: the sequence of convictions, the sequence of commission of offences, whether an offence occurred before or after a conviction, or any other matter`

@export Under section 345, have I stopped a mail conveyance with intent to rob or search it?
GIVEN `Did you stop a mail conveyance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you stop a mail conveyance?
      `Did you do so with intent to rob or search it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do so with intent to rob or search it?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 345, have I stopped a mail conveyance with intent to rob or search it` IS
    `s 345 the person commits the offence of stopping mail with intent` WITH
        `the person stops a mail conveyance` IS `Did you stop a mail conveyance`
        `the person does so with intent to rob or search it` IS `Did you do so with intent to rob or search it`

@export Under section 345, what is the most I can be sentenced to?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 345, what is the most I can be sentenced to` IS
    `s 345 the punishment for the offence`

@export Under section 346(1), have I committed extortion?
GIVEN `Did you act without reasonable justification or excuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act without reasonable justification or excuse?
      `Did you act with intent to obtain anything` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent to obtain anything?
      `Did you act by threats, accusations, menaces or violence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act by threats, accusations, menaces or violence?
      `Did you induce, or attempt to induce, any person to do anything or cause anything to be done` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you induce, or attempt to induce, any person to do anything or cause anything to be done?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 346(1), have I committed extortion` IS
    `s 346(1) the person commits extortion` WITH
        `the person acted without reasonable justification or excuse` IS `Did you act without reasonable justification or excuse`
        `the person acted with intent to obtain anything` IS `Did you act with intent to obtain anything`
        `the person acted by threats, accusations, menaces or violence` IS `Did you act by threats, accusations, menaces or violence`
        `the person induced or attempted to induce any person, whether or not that person is the person threatened, accused or menaced or to whom violence is shown, to do anything or cause anything to be done` IS `Did you induce, or attempt to induce, any person to do anything or cause anything to be done`

@export Under section 346(1.1), if I am convicted of extortion, what is the most and the least I can be sentenced to?
GIVEN `Was a restricted firearm used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a restricted firearm used in the commission of the offence?
      `Was a prohibited firearm used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a prohibited firearm used in the commission of the offence?
      `Was any firearm used in the commission of the offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was any firearm used in the commission of the offence?
      `Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization?
      `Is the group a criminal organization (see section 467.1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the group a criminal organization (see section 467.1)?
      `Is it a second or subsequent offence (see subsection (2) or (1.2))` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a second or subsequent offence (see subsection (2) or (1.2))?
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF Punishment)
DECIDE `Under section 346(1.1), if I am convicted of extortion, what is the most and the least I can be sentenced to` IS
    `s 346(1.1) the punishment for extortion` WITH
        `a restricted firearm is used in the commission of the offence, by s 2.1 restricted firearm` IS (JUST `Was a restricted firearm used in the commission of the offence`)
        `a prohibited firearm is used in the commission of the offence, by s 2.1 prohibited firearm` IS (JUST `Was a prohibited firearm used in the commission of the offence`)
        `any firearm is used in the commission of the offence, by s 2 firearm` IS (JUST `Was any firearm used in the commission of the offence`)
        `the offence is committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization` IS `Was the offence committed for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with, a criminal organization`
        `the group is a criminal organization, by s 2 criminal organization` IS (JUST `Is the group a criminal organization (see section 467.1)`)
        `the offence is a second or subsequent offence, by s 346(1.2)` IS `Is it a second or subsequent offence (see subsection (2) or (1.2))`

@export Under section 346(1.2), does my earlier conviction count as an earlier offence for section 346(1.1)?
GIVEN `What is the number of the section of the Code that the earlier offence was under` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of the section of the Code that the earlier offence was under?
      `What is the subsection, if any (for example "(1)"), or "" if none` IS A STRING @desc What is the subsection, if any (for example "(1)"), or "" if none?
      `Was a firearm used in the commission of the earlier offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a firearm used in the commission of the earlier offence?
      `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the day of the month (1 to 31) of your conviction for the earlier offence?
      `What is the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the month (1 to 12) of your conviction for the earlier offence?
      `What is the year of your conviction for the earlier offence` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the year of your conviction for the earlier offence?
      `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the day of the month (1 to 31) of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed?
      `What is the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the month (1 to 12) of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed?
      `What is the year of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the year of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed?
      `How many days were you in custody between those two convictions` IS A NUMBER @desc How many days were you in custody between those two convictions?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 346(1.2), does my earlier conviction count as an earlier offence for section 346(1.1)` IS
    `s 346(1.2) the earlier conviction is considered as an earlier offence` WITH
        `the earlier offence` IS (`Provision of the Code` OF `What is the number of the section of the Code that the earlier offence was under`, `What is the subsection, if any (for example "(1)"), or "" if none`)
        `a firearm was used in the commission of the earlier offence` IS `Was a firearm used in the commission of the earlier offence`
        `ten years have elapsed, by s 344(2) ten years have elapsed between the convictions, not taking into account any time in custody` IS (`s 344(2) ten years have elapsed between the convictions, not taking into account any time in custody` (Date `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` `What is the month of your conviction for the earlier offence` `What is the year of your conviction for the earlier offence`) (Date `What is the day of the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` `What is the month of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed` `What is the year of your conviction for the offence for which sentence is being imposed`) `How many days were you in custody between those two convictions`)

@export Under section 346(1.3), is the matter I describe to be considered when counting earlier offences?
GIVEN `What is it: the sequence of convictions, the sequence of commission of offences, whether an offence occurred before or after a conviction, or any other matter` IS A `s 344(3) matter` @desc What is it: the sequence of convictions, the sequence of commission of offences, whether an offence occurred before or after a conviction, or any other matter?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 346(1.3), is the matter I describe to be considered when counting earlier offences` IS
    `s 346(1.3) the matter is to be considered for the purposes of subsection (1.2)` WITH
        `matter` IS `What is it: the sequence of convictions, the sequence of commission of offences, whether an offence occurred before or after a conviction, or any other matter`

@export Under section 346(1.4), must the court consider as an aggravating factor that my extortion was of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose?
GIVEN `Have you been determined by a court to be guilty of an offence under section 346` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you been determined by a court to be guilty of an offence under section 346?
      `Was the offence of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the offence of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 346(1.4), must the court consider as an aggravating factor that my extortion was of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose` IS
    `s 346(1.4) the court must consider as an aggravating factor that the offence was of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose` WITH
        `the person has been determined by a court to be guilty of an offence under section 346` IS `Have you been determined by a court to be guilty of an offence under section 346`
        `the offence was of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose` IS `Was the offence of a sexual nature or committed for a sexual purpose`

@export Under section 346(2), is a threat to start a civil proceeding a threat for the purposes of extortion?
GIVEN `Was the threat a threat to institute civil proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the threat a threat to institute civil proceedings?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 346(2), is a threat to start a civil proceeding a threat for the purposes of extortion` IS
    `s 346(2) the threat is a threat for the purposes of section 346` WITH
        `the threat is a threat to institute civil proceedings` IS `Was the threat a threat to institute civil proceedings`

@export Under section 346.1, must my sentence for extortion be served consecutively to my sentence for arson?
GIVEN `Is the sentence imposed on you for an offence under section 346` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the sentence imposed on you for an offence under section 346?
      `What is the number of the section of the Code that the other offence is under (433 to 436 are the arson sections)` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the number of the section of the Code that the other offence is under (433 to 436 are the arson sections)?
      `What is the subsection, if any, or "" if none` IS A STRING @desc What is the subsection, if any, or "" if none?
      `Does the other offence arise out of the same event or series of events` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the other offence arise out of the same event or series of events?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 346.1, must my sentence for extortion be served consecutively to my sentence for arson` IS
    `s 346.1 the sentence shall be served consecutively to the other sentence` WITH
        `the sentence is imposed on the person for an offence under section 346` IS `Is the sentence imposed on you for an offence under section 346`
        `the other offence` IS (`Provision of the Code` OF `What is the number of the section of the Code that the other offence is under (433 to 436 are the arson sections)`, `What is the subsection, if any, or "" if none`)
        `the other offence arises out of the same event or series of events` IS `Does the other offence arise out of the same event or series of events`


§ `Sections 347 to 347.1 -- the criminal interest rate`
-- Receiving, offering or advertising interest above 35 per cent a year. The figures the text leaves to regulations, to another Act or to a designation order (347.01, 347.1(2)(a.1), (c)) are asked, never supplied.

@export Under section 347(1), have I received, offered or advertised interest at a criminal rate?
GIVEN `What is the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent, calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent, calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles?
      `Was that rate calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was that rate calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles?
      `Did you enter or offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement to receive interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you enter or offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement to receive interest?
      `Did you advertise an offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement that provides for the receipt of interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you advertise an offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement that provides for the receipt of interest?
      `Did you receive a payment or partial payment of interest` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive a payment or partial payment of interest?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(1), have I received, offered or advertised interest at a criminal rate` IS
    `s 347(1) the person commits the offence of receiving interest at a criminal rate` WITH
        `the rate is a criminal rate, by s 347(2) the rate is a criminal rate` IS (`s 347(2) the rate is a criminal rate` `What is the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent, calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles` `Was that rate calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles`)
        `the person enters or offers to enter into an agreement or arrangement to receive interest` IS `Did you enter or offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement to receive interest`
        `the person advertises an offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement that provides for the receipt of interest` IS `Did you advertise an offer to enter into an agreement or arrangement that provides for the receipt of interest`
        `the person receives a payment or partial payment of interest` IS `Did you receive a payment or partial payment of interest`

@export Under section 347(1), what is the most I can be sentenced to for receiving interest at a criminal rate?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 347(1), what is the most I can be sentenced to for receiving interest at a criminal rate` IS
    `s 347(1) the punishment for the offence`

@export Under section 347(2), is the rate a "criminal rate"?
GIVEN `What is the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent?
      `Was it calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), is the rate a "criminal rate"` IS
    `s 347(2) the rate is a criminal rate` WITH
        `the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent` IS `What is the annual percentage rate of interest on the credit advanced, in per cent`
        `the rate was calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles` IS `Was it calculated in accordance with generally accepted actuarial practices and principles`

@export Under section 347(2), what is the "credit advanced"?
GIVEN `How many dollars of money were actually advanced or are to be advanced` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of money were actually advanced or are to be advanced?
      `What is the monetary value, in dollars, of any goods, services or benefits actually advanced or to be advanced` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the monetary value, in dollars, of any goods, services or benefits actually advanced or to be advanced?
      `How many dollars are any required deposit balance` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars are any required deposit balance?
      `What is the total, in dollars, of any fee, fine, penalty, commission and other similar charge or expense incurred under the original or any collateral agreement` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total, in dollars, of any fee, fine, penalty, commission and other similar charge or expense incurred under the original or any collateral agreement?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), what is the "credit advanced"` IS
    `s 347(2) credit advanced` WITH
        `the money actually advanced or to be advanced, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of money were actually advanced or are to be advanced`
        `the monetary value of any goods, services or benefits actually advanced or to be advanced, in dollars` IS `What is the monetary value, in dollars, of any goods, services or benefits actually advanced or to be advanced`
        `the aggregate of any required deposit balance, in dollars` IS `How many dollars are any required deposit balance`
        `the aggregate of any fee, fine, penalty, commission and other similar charge or expense directly or indirectly incurred under the original or any collateral agreement or arrangement, in dollars` IS `What is the total, in dollars, of any fee, fine, penalty, commission and other similar charge or expense incurred under the original or any collateral agreement`

@export Under section 347(2), what is the "interest" I charged?
GIVEN `What is the total, in dollars, of all charges and expenses, in any form, paid or payable for the advancing of credit` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the total, in dollars, of all charges and expenses, in any form, paid or payable for the advancing of credit?
      `How many dollars of that is repayment of credit advanced` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of that is repayment of credit advanced?
      `How many dollars of that is an insurance charge` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of that is an insurance charge?
      `How many dollars of that is an official fee` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of that is an official fee?
      `How many dollars of that is an overdraft charge` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of that is an overdraft charge?
      `How many dollars of that is a required deposit balance` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of that is a required deposit balance?
      `Is the transaction a mortgage or hypothec transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the transaction a mortgage or hypothec transaction?
      `How many dollars of that is an amount required to be paid on account of property taxes` IS A NUMBER @desc How many dollars of that is an amount required to be paid on account of property taxes?
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), what is the "interest" I charged` IS
    `s 347(2) interest` WITH
        `the aggregate of all charges and expenses, in any form, paid or payable for the advancing of credit under the agreement or arrangement, in dollars` IS `What is the total, in dollars, of all charges and expenses, in any form, paid or payable for the advancing of credit`
        `the part of it that is repayment of credit advanced, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of that is repayment of credit advanced`
        `the part of it that is an insurance charge, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of that is an insurance charge`
        `the part of it that is an official fee, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of that is an official fee`
        `the part of it that is an overdraft charge, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of that is an overdraft charge`
        `the part of it that is a required deposit balance, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of that is a required deposit balance`
        `the transaction is a mortgage or hypothec transaction` IS `Is the transaction a mortgage or hypothec transaction`
        `the part of it that is an amount required to be paid on account of property taxes, in dollars` IS `How many dollars of that is an amount required to be paid on account of property taxes`

@export Under section 347(2), is the cost an "insurance charge"?
GIVEN `Is it the cost of insuring the risk assumed by the person who advances or is to advance credit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it the cost of insuring the risk assumed by the person who advances or is to advance credit?
      `What is the face amount of the insurance, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the face amount of the insurance, in dollars?
      `What is the credit advanced, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the credit advanced, in dollars?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), is the cost an "insurance charge"` IS
    `s 347(2) the cost is an insurance charge` WITH
        `it is the cost of insuring the risk assumed by the person who advances or is to advance credit under the agreement or arrangement` IS `Is it the cost of insuring the risk assumed by the person who advances or is to advance credit`
        `the face amount of the insurance, in dollars` IS `What is the face amount of the insurance, in dollars`
        `the credit advanced, in dollars` IS `What is the credit advanced, in dollars`

@export Under section 347(2), is the fee an "official fee"?
GIVEN `Is it a fee required by law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a fee required by law?
      `Is it to be paid to a governmental authority` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it to be paid to a governmental authority?
      `Is it in connection with perfecting any security under an agreement or arrangement for the advancing of credit` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it in connection with perfecting any security under an agreement or arrangement for the advancing of credit?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), is the fee an "official fee"` IS
    `s 347(2) the fee is an official fee` WITH
        `it is a fee required by law` IS `Is it a fee required by law`
        `it is to be paid to a governmental authority` IS `Is it to be paid to a governmental authority`
        `it is in connection with perfecting any security under an agreement or arrangement for the advancing of credit` IS `Is it in connection with perfecting any security under an agreement or arrangement for the advancing of credit`

@export Under section 347(2), is the charge an "overdraft charge"?
GIVEN `What is the amount of the charge, in dollars` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the amount of the charge, in dollars?
      `Is it for the creation of or increase in an overdraft` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it for the creation of or increase in an overdraft?
      `Is it imposed by a credit union or caisse populaire whose membership is wholly or substantially natural persons` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it imposed by a credit union or caisse populaire whose membership is wholly or substantially natural persons?
      `Is it imposed by a deposit taking institution whose deposits are insured, in whole or in part, by the Canada Deposit Insurance Corporation or guaranteed by the Quebec Deposit Insurance Board` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it imposed by a deposit taking institution whose deposits are insured, in whole or in part, by the Canada Deposit Insurance Corporation or guaranteed by the Quebec Deposit Insurance Board?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), is the charge an "overdraft charge"` IS
    `s 347(2) the charge is an overdraft charge` WITH
        `the amount of the charge, in dollars` IS `What is the amount of the charge, in dollars`
        `it is for the creation of or increase in an overdraft` IS `Is it for the creation of or increase in an overdraft`
        `it is imposed by a credit union or caisse populaire the membership of which is wholly or substantially comprised of natural persons` IS `Is it imposed by a credit union or caisse populaire whose membership is wholly or substantially natural persons`
        `it is imposed by a deposit taking institution the deposits in which are insured, in whole or in part, by the Canada Deposit Insurance Corporation or guaranteed, in whole or in part, by the Quebec Deposit Insurance Board` IS `Is it imposed by a deposit taking institution whose deposits are insured, in whole or in part, by the Canada Deposit Insurance Corporation or guaranteed by the Quebec Deposit Insurance Board`

@export Under section 347(2), is the amount a "required deposit balance"?
GIVEN `Is it a fixed or an ascertainable amount of the money actually advanced or to be advanced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a fixed or an ascertainable amount of the money actually advanced or to be advanced?
      `Is it required, as a condition of the agreement or arrangement, to be deposited or invested by or on behalf of the person to whom the advance is made` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it required, as a condition of the agreement or arrangement, to be deposited or invested by or on behalf of the person to whom the advance is made?
      `May it be available, if that person defaults in any payment, to or for the benefit of the person who advances the money` IS A BOOLEAN @desc May it be available, if that person defaults in any payment, to or for the benefit of the person who advances the money?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(2), is the amount a "required deposit balance"` IS
    `s 347(2) the amount is a required deposit balance` WITH
        `it is a fixed or an ascertainable amount of the money actually advanced or to be advanced under an agreement or arrangement` IS `Is it a fixed or an ascertainable amount of the money actually advanced or to be advanced`
        `it is required, as a condition of the agreement or arrangement, to be deposited or invested by or on behalf of the person to whom the advance is or is to be made` IS `Is it required, as a condition of the agreement or arrangement, to be deposited or invested by or on behalf of the person to whom the advance is made`
        `it may be available, in the event of that person defaulting in any payment, to or for the benefit of the person who advances or is to advance the money` IS `May it be available, if that person defaults in any payment, to or for the benefit of the person who advances the money`

@export Under section 347(3), am I deemed to know the nature of a payment of interest I received and that it was at a criminal rate?
GIVEN `Did you receive a payment or partial payment of interest at a criminal rate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you receive a payment or partial payment of interest at a criminal rate?
      `Is there evidence to the contrary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there evidence to the contrary?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(3), am I deemed to know the nature of a payment of interest I received and that it was at a criminal rate` IS
    `s 347(3) the person is deemed to have knowledge of the nature of the payment and that it was received at a criminal rate` WITH
        `the person receives a payment or partial payment of interest at a criminal rate` IS `Did you receive a payment or partial payment of interest at a criminal rate`
        `there is evidence to the contrary` IS `Is there evidence to the contrary`

@export Under section 347(4), is an actuary's certificate proof of the annual percentage rate of interest?
GIVEN `Are the proceedings under section 347` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are the proceedings under section 347?
      `Is it a certificate of a Fellow of the Canadian Institute of Actuaries` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a certificate of a Fellow of the Canadian Institute of Actuaries?
      `Does it state that they calculated the annual percentage rate of interest on any credit advanced` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it state that they calculated the annual percentage rate of interest on any credit advanced?
      `Does it set out the calculations and the information on which they are based` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does it set out the calculations and the information on which they are based?
      `Is there evidence to the contrary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is there evidence to the contrary?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(4), is an actuary's certificate proof of the annual percentage rate of interest` IS
    `s 347(4) the certificate is proof of the annual percentage rate of interest without proof of the signature or official character of the person appearing to have signed it` WITH
        `the proceedings are proceedings under section 347` IS `Are the proceedings under section 347`
        `the document is a certificate of a Fellow of the Canadian Institute of Actuaries` IS `Is it a certificate of a Fellow of the Canadian Institute of Actuaries`
        `it states that they have calculated the annual percentage rate of interest on any credit advanced` IS `Does it state that they calculated the annual percentage rate of interest on any credit advanced`
        `it sets out the calculations and the information on which they are based` IS `Does it set out the calculations and the information on which they are based`
        `there is evidence to the contrary` IS `Is there evidence to the contrary`

-- JUST FALSE is the text's no ("shall not be received in evidence unless ... notice ... together with a copy"). With notice and a copy the subsection stops barring the certificate but does not say it shall be received: NOTHING.
@export Under section 347(5), may the actuary's certificate be received in evidence against me?
GIVEN `Has the party intending to produce the certificate given you reasonable notice of that intention` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the party intending to produce the certificate given you reasonable notice of that intention?
      `Has that party given you a copy of the certificate` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has that party given you a copy of the certificate?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(5), may the actuary's certificate be received in evidence against me` IS
    `s 347(5) the certificate may be received in evidence` WITH
        `the party intending to produce the certificate has given to the accused or defendant reasonable notice of that intention` IS `Has the party intending to produce the certificate given you reasonable notice of that intention`
        `the party has given to the accused or defendant a copy of the certificate` IS `Has that party given you a copy of the certificate`

@export Under section 347(6), may I require the actuary to attend for cross-examination?
GIVEN `Is a certificate referred to in section 347(4) produced against you` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is a certificate referred to in section 347(4) produced against you?
      `Has the court given leave` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the court given leave?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(6), may I require the actuary to attend for cross-examination` IS
    `s 347(6) the accused or defendant may require the attendance of the actuary for the purposes of cross-examination` WITH
        `a certificate referred to in subsection (4) is produced against the accused or defendant` IS `Is a certificate referred to in section 347(4) produced against you`
        `the court has given leave` IS `Has the court given leave`

@export Under section 347(8), does section 347 apply to my transaction?
GIVEN `Does the Tax Rebate Discounting Act apply to the transaction` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the Tax Rebate Discounting Act apply to the transaction?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347(8), does section 347 apply to my transaction` IS
    `s 347(8) section 347 applies to the transaction` WITH
        `the Tax Rebate Discounting Act applies to the transaction` IS `Does the Tax Rebate Discounting Act apply to the transaction`

@export Under section 347.01(1), does section 347 apply to my agreement, arrangement, offer or advertisement?
GIVEN `Is the agreement or arrangement provided for by regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the agreement or arrangement provided for by regulation?
      `Is the offer, or the advertisement of an offer, to enter into an agreement or arrangement provided for by regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the offer, or the advertisement of an offer, to enter into an agreement or arrangement provided for by regulation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347.01(1), does section 347 apply to my agreement, arrangement, offer or advertisement` IS
    `s 347.01(1) section 347 applies to the agreement, arrangement, offer or advertisement` WITH
        `the agreement or arrangement is provided for by regulation` IS `Is the agreement or arrangement provided for by regulation`
        `the offer, or advertisement of an offer, to enter into an agreement or arrangement is provided for by regulation` IS `Is the offer, or the advertisement of an offer, to enter into an agreement or arrangement provided for by regulation`

@export Under section 347.01(2), does section 347 apply to my offer or advertisement?
GIVEN `Had the agreement or arrangement been entered into, would it have been considered to be provided for by regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Had the agreement or arrangement been entered into, would it have been considered to be provided for by regulation?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 347.01(2), does section 347 apply to my offer or advertisement` IS
    `s 347.01(2) section 347 applies to the offer or advertisement of an offer` WITH
        `had the agreement or arrangement been entered into, it would have been considered to be provided for by regulation` IS `Had the agreement or arrangement been entered into, would it have been considered to be provided for by regulation`

@export Under section 347.1(1), is the advancement of money a "payday loan"?
GIVEN `Is it an advancement of money` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an advancement of money?
      `Is it in exchange for a post-dated cheque, a pre-authorized debit or a future payment of a similar nature` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it in exchange for a post-dated cheque, a pre-authorized debit or a future payment of a similar nature?
