        `the proceedings are proceedings under section 348` IS `Are the proceedings under section 348`
        `there is evidence that the accused broke and entered a place or attempted to break and enter a place` IS `Is there evidence that you broke and entered a place or attempted to break and enter a place`
        `there is evidence to the contrary` IS `Is there evidence to the contrary`

