@export Under section 353.1(1), have I committed the offence of tampering with a vehicle identification number?
GIVEN `Did you act without lawful excuse` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act without lawful excuse?
      `Did you wholly or partially alter, remove or obliterate the number or mark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you wholly or partially alter, remove or obliterate the number or mark?
      `Is it a number or other mark placed on a motor vehicle to distinguish it from other similar motor vehicles` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it a number or other mark placed on a motor vehicle to distinguish it from other similar motor vehicles?
      `Is the vehicle drawn, propelled or driven by any means other than muscular power` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the vehicle drawn, propelled or driven by any means other than muscular power?
      `Is it railway equipment` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it railway equipment?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 353.1(1), have I committed the offence of tampering with a vehicle identification number` IS
    `s 353.1(1) the person commits the offence of tampering with a vehicle identification number` WITH
        `the person acted without lawful excuse` IS `Did you act without lawful excuse`
        `the person wholly or partially alters, removes or obliterates the number or mark` IS `Did you wholly or partially alter, remove or obliterate the number or mark`
        `the number or mark is a vehicle identification number, by s 353.1(2) the number or mark is a vehicle identification number` IS (JUST `Is it a number or other mark placed on a motor vehicle to distinguish it from other similar motor vehicles`)
        `the vehicle is a motor vehicle, by s 2 motor vehicle` IS (`s 2 motor vehicle` `Is the vehicle drawn, propelled or driven by any means other than muscular power` (JUST `Is it railway equipment`))

