        `the person did so during regular maintenance or any repair or other work done on the vehicle` IS `Did you do so during regular maintenance or any repair or other work done on the vehicle`
        `the work was done for a legitimate purpose, including a modification of the vehicle` IS `Was the work done for a legitimate purpose, including a modification of the vehicle`

