        `the person knows that all or part of it was obtained by or derived directly or indirectly from an act or omission anywhere that, if it had occurred in Canada, would have constituted an offence punishable by indictment` IS `Do you know that all or part of it was obtained by or derived directly or indirectly from an act or omission anywhere that, if it had occurred in Canada, would have constituted an offence punishable by indictment`

