      `Is it shown that anything was obtained by you by means of a cheque` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it shown that anything was obtained by you by means of a cheque?
      `Was the cheque, when presented for payment within a reasonable time, dishonoured on the ground that no funds or insufficient funds were on deposit to your credit in the bank or other institution on which it was drawn` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was the cheque, when presented for payment within a reasonable time, dishonoured on the ground that no funds or insufficient funds were on deposit to your credit in the bank or other institution on which it was drawn?
