        `the proceedings are proceedings under paragraph 362(1)(a)` IS `Are the proceedings under section 362(1)(a)`
        `it is shown that anything was obtained by the accused by means of a cheque` IS `Is it shown that anything was obtained by you by means of a cheque`
        `the cheque, when presented for payment within a reasonable time, was dishonoured on the ground that no funds or insufficient funds were on deposit to the credit of the accused in the bank or other institution on which the cheque was drawn` IS `Was the cheque, when presented for payment within a reasonable time, dishonoured on the ground that no funds or insufficient funds were on deposit to your credit in the bank or other institution on which it was drawn`
        `the court is satisfied by evidence that when the accused issued the cheque the accused believed on reasonable grounds that it would be honoured if presented for payment within a reasonable time after it was issued` IS `Is the court satisfied by evidence that when you issued the cheque you believed on reasonable grounds that it would be honoured if presented for payment within a reasonable time after it was issued`

