@export Under section 363, have I committed the offence of obtaining execution of a valuable security by fraud?
GIVEN `Did you act with intent to defraud or injure another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you act with intent to defraud or injure another person?
      `Did you make a representation of a matter of fact, either present or past, by words or otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make a representation of a matter of fact, either present or past, by words or otherwise?
      `Did you know that the representation was false` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know that the representation was false?
      `Did you make it with a fraudulent intent to induce the person to whom you made it to act on it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you make it with a fraudulent intent to induce the person to whom you made it to act on it?
      `Did you cause or induce any person to execute, make, accept, endorse or destroy the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you cause or induce any person to execute, make, accept, endorse or destroy the whole or any part of a valuable security?
      `Is the thing a valuable security (see section 2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the thing a valuable security (see section 2)?
      `Did you cause or induce any person to write, impress or affix a name or seal on any paper or parchment in order that it may afterwards be made or converted into or used or dealt with as a valuable security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you cause or induce any person to write, impress or affix a name or seal on any paper or parchment in order that it may afterwards be made or converted into or used or dealt with as a valuable security?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 363, have I committed the offence of obtaining execution of a valuable security by fraud` IS
    `s 363 the person commits the offence of obtaining execution of a valuable security by fraud` WITH
        `the person acted with intent to defraud or injure another person` IS `Did you act with intent to defraud or injure another person`
        `the person acted by a false pretence, by s 361(1) the representation is a false pretence` IS (`s 361(1) the representation is a false pretence` `Did you make a representation of a matter of fact, either present or past, by words or otherwise` `Did you know that the representation was false` `Did you make it with a fraudulent intent to induce the person to whom you made it to act on it`)
        `the person causes or induces any person to execute, make, accept, endorse or destroy the whole or any part of a valuable security` IS `Did you cause or induce any person to execute, make, accept, endorse or destroy the whole or any part of a valuable security`
        `the thing is a valuable security, by s 2 valuable security` IS (JUST `Is the thing a valuable security (see section 2)`)
        `the person causes or induces any person to write, impress or affix a name or seal on any paper or parchment in order that it may afterwards be made or converted into or used or dealt with as a valuable security` IS `Did you cause or induce any person to write, impress or affix a name or seal on any paper or parchment in order that it may afterwards be made or converted into or used or dealt with as a valuable security`

