GIVEN `Was a document made with the knowledge and intent referred to in section 366(1), whether or not you intended that any particular person should use or act on it as genuine` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was a document made with the knowledge and intent referred to in section 366(1), whether or not you intended that any particular person should use or act on it as genuine?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 366(3), is forgery complete` IS
    `s 366(3) forgery is complete` WITH
        `a document is made with the knowledge and intent referred to in subsection (1)` IS `Was a document made with the knowledge and intent referred to in section 366(1), whether or not you intended that any particular person should use or act on it as genuine`

