      `Do you possess it with intent to use, deal with or act on it as if it were genuine, to cause another to, or to transfer, sell or make it available` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you possess it with intent to use, deal with or act on it as if it were genuine, to cause another to, or to transfer, sell or make it available?
