    `s 368(1) the person commits the offence of using, trafficking in or possessing a forged document` WITH
        `the person knows or believes that the document is forged` IS `Do you know or believe that the document is forged`
        `the person uses, deals with or acts on it as if it were genuine` IS `Did you use, deal with or act on it as if it were genuine`
        `the person causes or attempts to cause any person to use, deal with or act on it as if it were genuine` IS `Did you cause or attempt to cause any person to use, deal with or act on it as if it were genuine`
        `the person transfers, sells or offers to sell it or makes it available, to any person` IS `Did you transfer, sell or offer to sell it, or make it available, to any person`
        `the person knows that or is reckless as to whether an offence will be committed under paragraph (a) or (b)` IS `Did you know that, or were you reckless as to whether, an offence would be committed by that person using, dealing with or acting on it, or causing another to`
        `the person possesses it with intent to commit an offence under any of paragraphs (a) to (c)` IS `Do you possess it with intent to use, deal with or act on it as if it were genuine, to cause another to, or to transfer, sell or make it available`

