GIVEN `the person is the holder of a lease or licence issued under an Act relating to the mining of valuable minerals, or by the owner of land that is supposed to contain valuable minerals` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you are the holder of a lease or licence issued under an Act relating to the mining of valuable minerals, or by the owner of land that is supposed to contain valuable minerals?
      `the person, by a fraudulent device or contrivance, defrauds or attempts to defraud any person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you, by a fraudulent device or contrivance, defraud or attempts to defraud any person?
      `the person is defrauded of valuable minerals obtained under or reserved by the lease or licence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is what you defrauded, or attempted to defraud, the other person of valuable minerals obtained under or reserved by the lease or licence?
      `the person is defrauded of money or a valuable interest or thing payable in respect of valuable minerals obtained or rights reserved by the lease or licence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is what you defrauded, or attempted to defraud, the other person of money or a valuable interest or thing payable in respect of valuable minerals obtained or rights reserved by the lease or licence?
      `the person fraudulently conceals or makes a false statement with respect to the amount of valuable minerals obtained under the lease or licence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you fraudulently conceal or make a false statement with respect to the amount of valuable minerals obtained under the lease or licence?
      `what the mineral is` IS A `s 2 valuable mineral kind` @desc What mineral is it (section 2, "valuable mineral")? Choose the one that applies.
      `the value of the mineral, in dollars per kilogram` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the value of the mineral, in dollars per kilogram?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 394(1), do I contravene subsection (1)` MEANS
    `s 394(1) the person contravenes subsection (1)` `the person is the holder of a lease or licence issued under an Act relating to the mining of valuable minerals, or by the owner of land that is supposed to contain valuable minerals` `the person, by a fraudulent device or contrivance, defrauds or attempts to defraud any person` `the person is defrauded of valuable minerals obtained under or reserved by the lease or licence` `the person is defrauded of money or a valuable interest or thing payable in respect of valuable minerals obtained or rights reserved by the lease or licence` `the person fraudulently conceals or makes a false statement with respect to the amount of valuable minerals obtained under the lease or licence` `what the mineral is` `the value of the mineral, in dollars per kilogram`

