-- calls `s 399 the conduct is the offence of a false return by a public officer`, `s 399 the class of the offence` and `s 399 the punishments`
@export Under section 399, is what I did the offence of a false return by a public officer, and what are its class and punishments?
GIVEN `the person is entrusted with the receipt, custody or management of any part of the public revenues` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you are entrusted with the receipt, custody or management of any part of the public revenues?
      `the person knowingly furnishes a false statement or return of any sum of money collected by them or entrusted to their care` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you knowingly furnish a false statement or return of any sum of money collected by them or entrusted to their care?
      `the person knowingly furnishes a false statement or return of any balance of money in their hands or under their control` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you knowingly furnish a false statement or return of any balance of money in their hands or under their control?
      `the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Section 787(1) is outside Parts X and XI, so this question asks you for it.)
      `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Enter 0 if it sets none.)
      `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that maximum term of imprisonment "less a day" (for example, two years less a day is 24 months, less a day)?
GIVETH A `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence`
`Under section 399, is what I did the offence of a false return by a public officer, and what are its class and punishments` MEANS
    `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence` OF
        (`s 399 the conduct is the offence of a false return by a public officer` `the person is entrusted with the receipt, custody or management of any part of the public revenues` `the person knowingly furnishes a false statement or return of any sum of money collected by them or entrusted to their care` `the person knowingly furnishes a false statement or return of any balance of money in their hands or under their control`)
        (JUST `s 399 the class of the offence`)
        (JUST (`s 399 the punishments` (`ccc13 seat the s 787(1) penalty` `the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day`)))

-- calls `s 400(1) the conduct is the offence of making a false prospectus`, `s 400(1) the class of the offence` and `s 400(1) the punishments`
@export Under section 400(1), is what I did the offence of making a false prospectus, and what are its class and punishments?
GIVEN `the person makes, circulates or publishes a prospectus, a statement or an account, whether written or oral` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you make, circulate or publish a prospectus, a statement or an account, whether written or oral?
      `the person knows it is false in a material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you know it are false in a material particular?
      `the body is a syndicate, body corporate or company, whether existing or proposed to be created` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is a syndicate, body corporate or company, whether existing or proposed to be created?
      `the intent is to induce persons to become shareholders or partners in the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to induce persons to become shareholders or partners in the company?
      `the intent is to deceive or defraud the members, shareholders or creditors of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to deceive or defraud the members, shareholders or creditors of the company?
      `the intent is to induce any person to entrust or advance anything to the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to induce any person to entrust or advance anything to the company?
      `the intent is to induce any person to enter into any security for the benefit of the company` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to induce any person to enter into any security for the benefit of the company?
      `the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Section 787(1) is outside Parts X and XI, so this question asks you for it.)
      `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Enter 0 if it sets none.)
      `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that maximum term of imprisonment "less a day" (for example, two years less a day is 24 months, less a day)?
GIVETH A `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence`
`Under section 400(1), is what I did the offence of making a false prospectus, and what are its class and punishments` MEANS
    `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence` OF
        (`s 400(1) the conduct is the offence of making a false prospectus` `the person makes, circulates or publishes a prospectus, a statement or an account, whether written or oral` `the person knows it is false in a material particular` (`s 400(2) the body is a company` `the body is a syndicate, body corporate or company, whether existing or proposed to be created`) `the intent is to induce persons to become shareholders or partners in the company` `the intent is to deceive or defraud the members, shareholders or creditors of the company` `the intent is to induce any person to entrust or advance anything to the company` `the intent is to induce any person to enter into any security for the benefit of the company`)
        (JUST `s 400(1) the class of the offence`)
        (JUST (`s 400(1) the punishments` (`ccc13 seat the s 787(1) penalty` `the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day`)))

