GIVEN `the body is a syndicate, body corporate or company, whether existing or proposed to be created` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is a syndicate, body corporate or company, whether existing or proposed to be created?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 400(2), is the body a company` MEANS
    `s 400(2) the body is a company` `the body is a syndicate, body corporate or company, whether existing or proposed to be created`

