`Under section 402.2(3), is the offence one the subsection includes` MEANS
    `s 402.2(3) the offence is one the subsection includes` (`Provision of the Code` OF `the offence (section number)`, `the offence (subsection)`)

-- calls `s 402.2(4) the accused may be tried and punished by the court`
