    `s 402.2(4) the subsection bars the proceeding for want of the consent of the Attorney General of the province` `the offence is alleged to have been committed outside the province in which the proceeding is commenced` `the consent of the Attorney General of that province has been given`

-- calls `s 403(1) the conduct is the offence of identity fraud`, `s 403(3) the class of the offence` and `s 403(3) the punishments`
@export Under section 403(1), is what I did the offence of identity fraud, and what are its class and punishments?
GIVEN `the person pretends to be the other person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you pretend to be the other person?
      `the person uses the other person’s identity information, whether by itself or in combination with identity information pertaining to any person, as if it pertains to the person using it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you use the other person’s identity information, whether by itself or in combination with identity information pertaining to any person, as if it pertains to the person using it?
      `the personation is fraudulent` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the personation is fraudulent?
      `the intent is to gain advantage for themselves or another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to gain advantage for themselves or another person?
      `the intent is to obtain any property or an interest in any property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to obtain any property or an interest in any property?
      `the intent is to cause disadvantage to the person being personated or another person` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to cause disadvantage to the person being personated or another person?
      `the intent is to avoid arrest or prosecution or to obstruct, pervert or defeat the course of justice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the intent is to avoid arrest or prosecution or to obstruct, pervert or defeat the course of justice?
      `the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Section 787(1) is outside Parts X and XI, so this question asks you for it.)
      `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Enter 0 if it sets none.)
      `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that maximum term of imprisonment "less a day" (for example, two years less a day is 24 months, less a day)?
GIVETH A `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence`
`Under section 403(1), is what I did the offence of identity fraud, and what are its class and punishments` MEANS
    `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence` OF
        (`s 403(1) the conduct is the offence of identity fraud` (`s 403(2) the conduct is personating a person` `the person pretends to be the other person` `the person uses the other person’s identity information, whether by itself or in combination with identity information pertaining to any person, as if it pertains to the person using it`) `the personation is fraudulent` `the intent is to gain advantage for themselves or another person` `the intent is to obtain any property or an interest in any property` `the intent is to cause disadvantage to the person being personated or another person` `the intent is to avoid arrest or prosecution or to obstruct, pervert or defeat the course of justice`)
        (JUST `s 403(3) the class of the offence`)
        (JUST (`s 403(3) the punishments` (`ccc13 seat the s 787(1) penalty` `the maximum fine, in dollars, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day`)))

