      `the person makes or reproduces in any manner that trademark or a mark so nearly resembling it as to be calculated to deceive` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you make or reproduces in any manner that trademark or a mark so nearly resembling it as to be calculated to deceive?
      `the person falsifies, in any manner, a genuine trademark` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you falsify, in any manner, a genuine trademark?
