      `the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A NUMBER @desc What is the maximum term of imprisonment, in months, that section 787(1) of the Criminal Code sets for an offence punishable on summary conviction? (Enter 0 if it sets none.)
      `that maximum term of imprisonment under section 787(1) is less a day` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is that maximum term of imprisonment "less a day" (for example, two years less a day is 24 months, less a day)?
GIVETH A `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence`
`Under section 424, is what I did the offence of a threat against an internationally protected person, and what are its class and punishments` MEANS
    `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence` OF
        (`s 424 the conduct is the offence of a threat against an internationally protected person` `the person threatens to commit the offence` (`Provision of the Code` OF `the offence threatened (section number)`, `the offence threatened (subsection)`) (`s 2 internationally protected person` `basis (internationally protected person)` `at the time and place of an offence referred to in subsection 7(3) against the person or property referred to in section 431 used by them, the representative, official or agent is entitled, pursuant to international law, to special protection from any attack on their person, freedom or dignity`))
