@export Under section 431.2(2), is what I did the offence of delivering an explosive or other lethal device, and what are its class and punishments?
GIVEN `the person delivers, places, discharges or detonates the device to, into, in or against the place, facility or system` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you deliver, place, discharge or detonate the device to, into, in or against the place, facility or system?
      `kind (s 431.2(1))` IS A `s 431.2(1) kind of device` @desc Choose the kind of device that applies (section 431.2(1)).
      `it is designed to cause, or is capable of causing, death, serious bodily injury or substantial material damage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the device is designed to cause, or is capable of causing, death, serious bodily injury or substantial material damage?
      `it is a part of land, a building, street, waterway or other location that is accessible or open to members of the public, whether on a continuous, periodic or occasional basis` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the place is a part of land, a building, street, waterway or other location that is accessible or open to members of the public, whether on a continuous, periodic or occasional basis?
      `it is a facility or conveyance, whether permanent or temporary` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that it is a facility or conveyance, whether permanent or temporary?
      `users (government or public facility)` IS A `s 2 government or public facility: who uses it` @desc Who uses the facility or conveyance (section 2, "government or public facility")? Choose the one that applies.
      `it is used or occupied in connection with their official duties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that it is used or occupied in connection with their official duties?
      `it is a publicly or privately owned facility, conveyance or other thing that is used in connection with publicly available services for the transportation of persons or cargo` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the thing is a publicly or privately owned facility, conveyance or other thing that is used in connection with publicly available services for the transportation of persons or cargo?
      `it is a publicly or privately owned facility that provides or distributes services for the benefit of the public` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the facility is a publicly or privately owned facility that provides or distributes services for the benefit of the public?
      `the person acts with intent to cause death or serious bodily injury` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you act with intent to cause death or serious bodily injury?
      `the person acts with intent to cause extensive destruction of such a place, system or facility that results in or is likely to result in major economic loss` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that you act with intent to cause extensive destruction of such a place, system or facility that results in or are likely to result in major economic loss?
      `the act or omission is committed during an armed conflict` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the act or omission is committed during an armed conflict?
      `at the time and in the place of its commission it is in accordance with customary international law or conventional international law applicable to the conflict` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that at the time and in the place of its commission it is in accordance with customary international law or conventional international law applicable to the conflict?
      `they are the armed forces that a state organizes, trains and equips in accordance with the law of the state for the primary purpose of national defence or national security` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body is the armed forces that a state organizes, trains and equips in accordance with the law of the state for the primary purpose of national defence or national security?
      `they are a person acting in support of those armed forces who is under their formal command, control and responsibility` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the body or person are a person acting in support of those armed forces who is under their formal command, control and responsibility?
      `the activity is undertaken in the exercise of their official duties` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the activity is undertaken in the exercise of their official duties?
      `the activity is governed by other rules of international law` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the activity is governed by other rules of international law?
GIVETH A `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence`
`Under section 431.2(2), is what I did the offence of delivering an explosive or other lethal device, and what are its class and punishments` MEANS
    `s 380 to 447.1 answer about an offence` OF
        (`s 431.2(2) the conduct is the offence of delivering an explosive or other lethal device` `the person delivers, places, discharges or detonates the device to, into, in or against the place, facility or system` (`s 431.2(1) the device is an explosive or other lethal device` `kind (s 431.2(1))` `it is designed to cause, or is capable of causing, death, serious bodily injury or substantial material damage`) (`s 431.2(1) the place is a place of public use` `it is a part of land, a building, street, waterway or other location that is accessible or open to members of the public, whether on a continuous, periodic or occasional basis`) (`s 2 government or public facility` `it is a facility or conveyance, whether permanent or temporary` `users (government or public facility)` `it is used or occupied in connection with their official duties`) (`s 431.2(1) the thing is a public transportation system` `it is a publicly or privately owned facility, conveyance or other thing that is used in connection with publicly available services for the transportation of persons or cargo`) (`s 431.2(1) the facility is an infrastructure facility` `it is a publicly or privately owned facility that provides or distributes services for the benefit of the public`) `the person acts with intent to cause death or serious bodily injury` `the person acts with intent to cause extensive destruction of such a place, system or facility that results in or is likely to result in major economic loss` (`s 431.2(3) subsection (2) does not apply to the act or omission` `the act or omission is committed during an armed conflict` `at the time and in the place of its commission it is in accordance with customary international law or conventional international law applicable to the conflict` (`s 431.2(1) the body or person is the military forces of a state` `they are the armed forces that a state organizes, trains and equips in accordance with the law of the state for the primary purpose of national defence or national security` `they are a person acting in support of those armed forces who is under their formal command, control and responsibility`) `the activity is undertaken in the exercise of their official duties` `the activity is governed by other rules of international law`))
        (JUST `s 431.2(2) the class of the offence`)
        (JUST (`s 431.2(2) the punishments`))

