§ `PART XII.2 -- Proceeds of Crime (ss 462.3 to 462.5)`
-- Ask this group if you are, or may be, accused of laundering the proceeds of crime, or if the police or the Crown have seized, restrained or applied to forfeit property of yours.

@export Under section 462.3(1), is the offence a designated offence?
GIVEN `form of the charge` IS A STRING @desc What is the charge? One of: "offence" (the offence itself), "conspiracy", "attempt", "accessory" (being an accessory after the fact), "counselling" (counselling in relation to the offence), or "other".
      `it may be prosecuted as an indictable offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Can the offence be prosecuted as an indictable offence under this or any other Act of Parliament?
      `it is excluded by regulation` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it an indictable offence that a regulation under section 462.3(2) excludes?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 462.3(1), is the offence a designated offence` IS
    `s 462.3(1) designated offence` (`ccc14 seat form of the charge` `form of the charge`) `it may be prosecuted as an indictable offence` `it is excluded by regulation`

@export Under section 462.3(1), is the property proceeds of crime?
GIVEN `it is property, a benefit or an advantage` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it property, a benefit or an advantage, within or outside Canada?
      `it came from a designated offence committed in Canada` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it obtained or derived, directly or indirectly, as a result of the commission in Canada of a designated offence?
      `it came from an act abroad that would be a designated offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it obtained or derived as a result of an act or omission anywhere that, had it occurred in Canada, would have been a designated offence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 462.3(1), is the property proceeds of crime` IS
    `s 462.3(1) proceeds of crime` `it is property, a benefit or an advantage` (`ccc14 seat means answer` `it came from a designated offence committed in Canada`) (`ccc14 seat means answer` `it came from an act abroad that would be a designated offence`)

@export Under section 462.31(1), have I committed the offence of laundering proceeds of crime?
GIVEN `I dealt with the property` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you use, transfer possession of, send, deliver, transport, transmit, alter, dispose of or otherwise deal with any property or proceeds of property, in any manner and by any means?
      `I meant to conceal or convert it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do it with intent to conceal or convert that property or those proceeds?
      `I knew, believed or was reckless` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you know or believe, or were you reckless as to whether, all or part of it was obtained or derived from a designated offence?
      `it came from a designated offence in Canada` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it obtained or derived from the commission in Canada of a designated offence?
      `it came from an act abroad that would be a designated offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it obtained or derived from an act or omission anywhere that, had it occurred in Canada, would have been a designated offence?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 462.31(1), have I committed the offence of laundering proceeds of crime` IS
    `s 462.31(1) the person commits the offence of laundering proceeds of crime` `I dealt with the property` `I meant to conceal or convert it` `I knew, believed or was reckless` (`ccc14 seat means answer` `it came from a designated offence in Canada`) (`ccc14 seat means answer` `it came from an act abroad that would be a designated offence`)

@export Under section 462.31(2), what punishment can I be given for laundering proceeds of crime?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 462.31(2), what punishment can I be given for laundering proceeds of crime` IS
    `s 462.31(2) the punishment`

@export Under section 462.31(2.1), have I committed the offence of laundering proceeds of crime for a criminal organization?
GIVEN `I laundered proceeds of crime` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you commit the offence of laundering proceeds of crime (the section 462.31(1) question)?
      `I did it for a criminal organization` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did you do it for the benefit of, at the direction of, or in association with a criminal organization?
      `the group is a criminal organization` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the group a criminal organization (the section 467.1(1) question)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 462.31(2.1), have I committed the offence of laundering proceeds of crime for a criminal organization` IS
    `s 462.31(2.1) the person commits the offence of laundering proceeds of crime for a criminal organization` (`ccc14 seat includes answer` `I laundered proceeds of crime`) `I did it for a criminal organization` (`ccc14 seat means answer` `the group is a criminal organization`)

@export Under section 462.31(2.1), what punishment can I be given for laundering proceeds of crime for a criminal organization?
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
DECIDE `Under section 462.31(2.1), what punishment can I be given for laundering proceeds of crime for a criminal organization` IS
    `s 462.31(2.1) the punishment`

