GIVEN `my dealings were markedly unusual` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court satisfied that the manner in which you dealt with the property was markedly unusual?
      `my dealings do not fit the sector` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the court satisfied that your dealings are inconsistent with lawful activities typical of the sector in which they took place, including business activities?
      `I am also charged with the designated offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Are you also charged with the designated offence itself?
