      `longest term in years` IS A NUMBER @desc If not life: what is the longest term of imprisonment for the alleged offence, in years? (0 if none is stated)
      `the law expressly provides otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does another law expressly provide a different rule?
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF Punishment)
DECIDE `Under section 465(1)(b), what punishment can I be given for conspiring to prosecute a person for an offence they did not commit` IS
    `s 465(1)(b) the punishment for conspiring to prosecute a person for an offence they did not commit` (`ccc14 seat longest term` `the alleged offence carries life imprisonment` `longest term in years`) `the law expressly provides otherwise`

