GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF Punishment)
DECIDE `Under section 465(1)(c), what punishment can I be given for conspiring to commit an indictable offence` IS
    `s 465(1)(c) the punishment for conspiring to commit an indictable offence` (`ccc14 seat class of the offence` `the offence is indictable` `it can also be tried as a summary conviction offence`) (`ccc14 seat punishment limbs` `the offence is indictable` `it can also be tried as a summary conviction offence` `it carries life imprisonment` `longest term in years`) `the law expressly provides otherwise`

