    `s 555(2) the provincial court judge shall put the accused to their election in accordance with subsection 536(2.1)` `I am before a provincial court judge in proceedings under Part XIX` `the offence as paragraph 553(a) names it` `the offence is prosecuted by indictment` `the provincial court judge has made an adjudication` `the evidence establishes that the subject matter of the offence is a testamentary instrument or that its value exceeds 5,000 dollars`

