    `s 672.92(1) the peace officer may release the accused from custody, issue a summons or appearance notice and deliver the accused to the place specified` `a peace officer arrests the accused under section 672.91` `the accused is subject to a disposition made under paragraph 672.54(b) or an assessment order` `the peace officer acts as soon as practicable` `the peace officer issues a summons or appearance notice compelling the accused’s appearance before a justice` `the peace officer delivers the accused to the place specified in the disposition or assessment order`

