      `the peace officer believes, on reasonable grounds, that the accused is subject to a disposition or an assessment order of a court, or Review Board, of another province` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the peace officer believe, on reasonable grounds, that you are subject to a disposition or an assessment order of a court, or Review Board, of another province?
      `the peace officer believes, on reasonable grounds, that, if the accused is released from custody, the accused will fail to attend, as required, before a justice` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the peace officer believe, on reasonable grounds, that, if you are released from custody, you will fail to attend, as required, before a justice?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
