-- answers: s 676(6) the Attorney General may appeal to the court of appeal against the decision of the court not to make an order under subsection 745.51(1)
@export Under section 676(6), may the Attorney General appeal against the court's decision not to make an order against me under subsection 745.51(1)?
GIVEN `the appeal is brought by the Attorney General or counsel instructed by the Attorney General for the purpose` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the appeal brought by the Attorney General, or by counsel the Attorney General instructed for the purpose?
      `the court decided not to make an order against me under subsection 745.51(1)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the court decide not to make an order against you under subsection 745.51(1)?
