DECIDE `Under section 687(1)(a), may the court of appeal vary my sentence` IS
    `s 687(1)(a) the court of appeal may vary the sentence` `an appeal is taken against my sentence` `the variation is within the limits the law prescribes for my offence`

-- answers: s 688(1) an appellant who is in custody is entitled to be present at the hearing of the appeal
@export Under section 688(1), am I entitled to be present at the hearing of my appeal while I am in custody?
