GIVEN `I have been found unfit to stand trial` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you been found unfit to stand trial?
      `the court of appeal affirmed that verdict` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Did the court of appeal affirm that verdict?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 692(2), may I appeal to the Supreme Court of Canada against a verdict that I am unfit to stand trial` IS
