      `the appellant is the Attorney General` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the appeal taken by the Attorney General?
      `the appeal is on a question of law on which a judge of the court of appeal dissents` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the appeal on a question of law on which a judge of the court of appeal dissented?
      `the appeal is on a question of law and leave has been granted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the appeal on a question of law, with leave granted by the Supreme Court of Canada?
