    `s 694 notice of appeal in writing has been served by the appellant on the respondent in accordance with the Supreme Court Act` `notice of appeal in writing has been served on the respondent in accordance with the Supreme Court Act`

-- answers: s 694.1(1) the Supreme Court of Canada or a judge may assign counsel to act on behalf of an accused who is a party to an appeal to the Court
@export Under section 694.1(1), may the Supreme Court of Canada assign a lawyer to act for me on my appeal to it?
