      `I have been found to be a dangerous offender or a long-term offender under Part XXIV` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have you been found to be a dangerous offender or a long-term offender under Part XXIV?
      `my rights of judicial review or appeal have been exhausted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have your rights of judicial review or appeal about the conviction or finding been exhausted?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
