    `s 714.6 the evidence is deemed to be given in Canada, and given under oath or affirmation in accordance with Canadian law, for the purposes of the laws relating to evidence, procedure, perjury and contempt of court` `the witness is outside Canada` `the witness gives evidence under section 714.2 or 714.3`

-- answers: s 714.7 the party shall pay the costs associated with the use of the technology
@export Under section 714.7, must the party who calls a witness by video or audio link pay the costs of the technology?
GIVEN `the party calls a witness to give evidence by means of the technology` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the party call a witness to give evidence by audioconference or videoconference under section 714.1, 714.2 or 714.3?
      `the court orders otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the court ordered otherwise?
