      `the minimum imprisonment the offence charged carries (days)` IS A NUMBER @desc If it is a term, how many days does it last? (0 if it is for life or there is none)
      `the minimum imprisonment the offence charged carries (less a day)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc If it is a term, is it "less a day" (for example, two years less a day)? (No if it is for life or there is none)
