    `s 733(1) the court that made the order may transfer the order` `the court is the court that made the probation order` `the offender who is bound by a probation order becomes a resident of, or is convicted or discharged under section 730 in, a territorial division other than the territorial division where the order was made` `a probation officer applies` (JUST `the consent the transfer needs has been given`) `the court to which the order is transferred would, having regard to the mode of trial of the offender, have had jurisdiction to make the order there if the offender had been tried and convicted there of the offence`

