      `the term of imprisonment in default of payment of the fine provided for in that Act or regulation is specified, either as a minimum or a maximum` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is it true that the term of imprisonment in default of payment of the fine provided for in that Act or regulation is specified, either as a minimum or a maximum?
