    `s 734(8) subsections 734(4) and (5) apply to the fine` `the fine is imposed under an Act of Parliament` `the term of imprisonment in default of payment of the fine provided for in that Act or regulation is calculated by a different method` `the term of imprisonment in default of payment of the fine provided for in that Act or regulation is specified, either as a minimum or a maximum`

