GIVEN `the defendant fails or refuses to enter into the recognizance` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do you fail or refuse to enter into the recognizance?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 810(3.01), may the justice or court commit me to prison` MEANS
    `s 810(3.01) the justice or court may commit the defendant to prison` `the defendant fails or refuses to enter into the recognizance`

