GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Under section 810.01(3), may the provincial court judge order that I enter into a recognizance` MEANS
    `s 810.01(3) the provincial court judge may order that the defendant enter into a recognizance` `the provincial court judge is satisfied by the evidence adduced that the informant has reasonable grounds for the fear`

