      `the day the conduct was engaged in` IS A DATE @desc On what day did I engage in the conduct I am to be sentenced for?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 42.1 of 2015 c 13, is the conduct I may be sentenced for within the limit on the amendment to paragraph 718.2(e)` IS
    `2015 c 13 s 42.1 the conduct is within the limit on the amendment to paragraph 718.2(e)` `the day on which section 24 of 2015, c. 13 comes into force` `the day the conduct was engaged in`

