-- layer 1: `2015 c 20 s 28 the information is deemed to have been laid under subsection 810.011(1)`
@export Is the information laid against me by a person who feared that I would commit a terrorism offence, which was under subsection 810.01(1), treated as laid under subsection 810.011(1) (2015, c. 20, s. 28)?
