      `the information was laid by a person who fears on reasonable grounds that another person will commit a terrorism offence` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it laid by a person who fears on reasonable grounds that another person will commit a terrorism offence?
      `a provincial court judge has not made a final determination with respect to the information` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has a provincial court judge not yet made a final determination about the information?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
