    `2015 c 20 s 28 the information is deemed to have been laid under subsection 810.011(1)` `the information was laid under subsection 810.01(1) before the day on which section 28 of 2015, c. 20 comes into force` `the information was laid by a person who fears on reasonable grounds that another person will commit a terrorism offence` `a provincial court judge has not made a final determination with respect to the information`

§ `Transitional provisions of amending Acts, 2018 to 2023 -- impaired driving, bail, mode of trial, time limits, searches, interest`

-- layer 1: `2018 c 12 s 406(1) a remediation agreement may be entered into in respect of the offence`
@export May a remediation agreement be entered into in respect of an offence alleged to have been committed before the day section 404 of 2018, c. 12 came into force (2018, c. 12, s. 406(1))?
GIVEN `the day on which section 404 of 2018, c. 12 comes into force` IS A DATE @desc On what day did section 404 of 2018, c. 12 come into force?
      `the day the offence is alleged to have been committed` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the offence alleged to have been committed?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 406(1) of 2018 c 12, may a remediation agreement be entered into for an offence alleged to have been committed before section 404 came into force` IS
    `2018 c 12 s 406(1) a remediation agreement may be entered into in respect of the offence` `the day on which section 404 of 2018, c. 12 comes into force` `the day the offence is alleged to have been committed`

-- layer 1: `2018 c 21 s 10 the thing is deemed to be approved, as the same kind of thing, under section 254.01 as enacted by section 4`
@export Is the approved instrument, approved screening device or approved container used on me treated as approved under section 254.01, because it was approved under subsection 254(1) as that read before the change (2018, c. 21, s. 10)?
GIVEN `the kind I choose` IS A `2018 c 21 s 10 kind of thing approved` @desc Is it an approved instrument, an approved screening device or an approved container?
      `it was approved under subsection 254(1) as it read immediately before the day on which subsection 3(1) of 2018, c. 21 comes into force` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Was it approved under subsection 254(1) as it read immediately before the day subsection 3(1) of 2018, c. 21 came into force?
