-- layer 1: `2019 c 25 s 359 the person may elect another mode of trial`
@export May I elect another mode of trial, despite the new limits in subparagraph 561(1)(b)(i) and subsections 561(2) and 561.1(2), if I was accused before section 254 of 2019, c. 25 came into force (2019, c. 25, s. 359)?
