      `s 561 the person is in one of the cases described in subparagraph 561(1)(b)(i) or subsection 561(2) or 561.1(2) as enacted by 2019, c. 25` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Am I in one of the cases described in subparagraph 561(1)(b)(i) or subsection 561(2) or 561.1(2) as enacted by 2019, c. 25?
      `the person has already elected another mode of trial` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have I already elected another mode of trial?
      `the day the person elects another mode of trial` IS A DATE @desc On what day do I elect (or want to elect) another mode of trial?
      `the day first appointed for the trial` IS A DATE @desc On what day is the trial first appointed for?
      `the prosecutor consents in writing` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Has the prosecutor consented in writing?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 359 of 2019 c 25, may I elect another mode of trial` IS
    `2019 c 25 s 359 the person may elect another mode of trial` `the person was accused of the offence before the day on which section 254 of 2019, c. 25 comes into force` (JUST `s 561 the person is in one of the cases described in subparagraph 561(1)(b)(i) or subsection 561(2) or 561.1(2) as enacted by 2019, c. 25`) `the person has already elected another mode of trial` `the day the person elects another mode of trial` `the day first appointed for the trial` `the prosecutor consents in writing`

-- layer 1: `2019 c 25 s 360 the proceedings are within the time limit`
