      `the day the proceedings are instituted` IS A DATE @desc On what day are (or were) the proceedings instituted?
      `the prosecutor and the defendant so agree` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Do the prosecutor and I agree that proceedings may go ahead after the six months?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
