    `2019 c 25 s 360 the proceedings are within the time limit` `the offence is punishable on summary conviction` `the day the offence was committed` `the day on which section 315 of 2019, c. 25 comes into force` `the day the subject matter of the proceedings arose` `the day the proceedings are instituted` `the prosecutor and the defendant so agree`

