      `the application is made by the person or on the person’s behalf` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Is the application made by me or on my behalf?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 696.2(1) (not in force), may an application for a review on the grounds of miscarriage of justice be made to the Commission by or on behalf of me` IS
    `s 696.2(1) (not in force) an application for a review on the grounds of miscarriage of justice may be made to the Commission by or on behalf of the person` `the person I choose` `the application is made by the person or on the person’s behalf`

