      `the person’s rights to appeal the finding or verdict have been exhausted` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have my rights to appeal the finding or verdict been exhausted?
      `the application includes information relevant to the factors referred to in subsection 696.4(4)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the application include information relevant to the factors referred to in subsection 696.4(4)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Under section 696.2(2) (not in force), does my application include what it must include` IS
